    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyalaeg gaijgwz huciz cidu, bineix saedyienh 1300 fanh vunz doxhwnj an'gya roengzhoh hawsingz, gyavaiq cienzmienh saedhengz gihcucwng cidu.",
