    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cietsaed doeksaed gij gienzguhcawj gauhyau caeuq gohyenz yensoj, doeksaed gij cwngcwz gikcoi gujgienz geizgienz caeuq faenhoengz daengj, doeksaed gaijgwz aen cidu guenjleix gohyenz ginghfei caeuq hanghmoeg, hawj boux guh hong gohyenz mbouj caiq vih saeh saepsoiq faensim feiqheiq.",
