        "zhuang": "Dazyinx doiq rog douzswh cangqheiq gveihfan fazcanj, daezswng gij naengzlig fuengzre fungyiemj.",
        "zh": "引导对外投资健康规范发展，提升风险防范能力。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aen daihmonz Cungguek hailangh yaek yied hai yied gvangq, bietdingh yaek laebdaeb bienqbaenz giz dieg ceiq ndaej supyinx canghseng'eiq guekrog douzswh.",
        "zh": "中国开放的大门会越开越大，必将继续成为最富吸引力的外商投资目的地。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doicaenh gozci mouyiz caeuq douzswh ndaej swyouz bienhleih.",
        "zh": "推进国际贸易和投资自由化便利化。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ginghci cenzgiuzva hab gij gaenbonj leih'ik seiqgyaiq gak guek.",
        "zh": "经济全球化符合世界各国的根本利益。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cungguek yaek giendingh mbouj bienq bae doidoengh seiqgyaiq ginghci gapguh, henhoh aen diegvih roen goek lai mbiengj mouyiz dijci, gaenxmaenx caeuqfaenh lai mbiengj mouyiz damzbuenq.",
        "zh": "中国将坚定不移推动全球经济合作，维护多边贸易体制主渠道地位，积极参与多边贸易谈判。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dou nyienh caeuq mizgven guekgya itheij, doidoengh mbaw saw yaengdingh Cungguek - Dunghmungz Swmougih swnggaep ndaej cienzmienh seng'yauq saedhengz, caeuxdi gietsat gij damzbuenq aen gihyiz cienzmienh ginghci gapdoih gvanhaeh hezding, doicaenh Ya Dai Swmougih gensez.",
        "zh": "我们愿与有关国家一道，推动中国－东盟自贸区升级议定书全面生效实施，早日结束区域全面经济伙伴关系协定谈判，推进亚太自贸区建设。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laebdaeb caeuq mizgven guekgya nem digih yaengdamz douzswh mouyiz hezding.",
        "zh": "继续与有关国家和地区商谈投资贸易协定。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cungguek dwg aen guekgya gamj rap cwzyin, itcig cungj nyinhcaen hengzguh gij wngqcingz gaenq guh'ok, yaek giengiet henhoh gij gienzik wnggai miz de.",
        "zh": "中国是负责任的国家，作出的承诺一直认真履行，应有的权益将坚决捍卫。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "（Caet）Gyarengz baujhoh ceihleix swnghdai vanzging.",
        "zh": "（七）加大生态环境保护治理力度。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyavaiq gaijndei swnghdai vanzging daegbied dwg hoengheiq caetliengh, dwg aen simmuengh gaenjbik vunzlai, dwg ndaej laebdaeb fazcanj iugouz baenzneix guh.",
        "zh": "加快改善生态环境特别是空气质量，是人民群众的迫切愿望，是可持续发展的内在要求。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bietdingh aeu gohyoz bae guh、goek byai giem ceih、yiemzhaenq ceihleix, roengzrengz gyau faenh gienj habgek hawj vunzlai.",
        "zh": "必须科学施策、标本兼治、铁腕治理，努力向人民群众交出合格答卷。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Giengiet guh ndei gij hong baujhoh mbwnlamz.",
        "zh": "坚决打好蓝天保卫战。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bineix baizcuengq wyangjvaliuz、danyangjvavuz soqliengh aeu faenbied doekdaemq 3％, dieg cungdenj naedfaenx (PM2.5 ) noengzdoh aeu doekdaemq yienhda.",
        "zh": "今年二氧化硫、氮氧化物排放量要分别下降3%，重点地区细颗粒物（PM2.5）浓度明显下降。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "It aeu gyavaiq gaijgez aen vwndiz coemh meiz uqlah.",
        "zh": "一要加快解决燃煤污染问题。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cienzmienh saedhengz gyoebhab ceihleix meiz sanq, doicaenh dieg Baihbaek seizdoeng cinghseuq aeu raeuj, guhbaenz aeu dienh dingj meiz、aeu heiq lawh meiz 300 fanh hoh doxhwnj, cienzbouh raengcawz gij gohluz iq coemh meiz ndaw aen hawsingz didingh gaep doxhwnj bae.",
        "zh": "全面实施散煤综合治理，推进北方地区冬季清洁取暖，完成以电代煤、以气代煤300万户以上，全部淘汰地级以上城市建成区燃煤小锅炉。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyarengz gaijcauh doengh aen dencangj coemh meiz de baenz baizcuengq gig noix caeuq mbaetyungh nwngzyenz bae, dieg Baihdoeng、dieg Cungqgyang aeu faenbied youq bineix bimoq guhbaenz, dieg Baihsae youq 2020 nienz guhbaenz.",
        "zh": "加大燃煤电厂超低排放和节能改造力度，东中部地区要分别于今明两年完成，西部地区于2020年完成。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cagaenj gaijgez gihci caeuq gisuz vwndiz, sien baujcang gij nwngzyenz cinghseuq de fatdienh hwnjvangj gonq, mizyauq gemjrwnh yiengh raemx、rumz、ndit fatdienh cuengqndwi.",
        "zh": "抓紧解决机制和技术问题，优先保障清洁能源发电上网，有效缓解弃水、弃风、弃光状况。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ancienz yauq sang dwk fazcanj hwzden.",
        "zh": "安全高效发展核电。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyavaiq gyoebhab leihyungh ganjnyaq doenghgo.",
        "zh": "加快秸秆综合利用。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngeih aeu cienzmienh doicaenh ceihleix goek uqlah.",
        "zh": "二要全面推进污染源治理。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Guh aen hengzdoengh cienhangh ceihleix hangznieb uqlah youqgaenj.",
        "zh": "开展重点行业污染治理专项行动。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doiq sojmiz goek uqlah aen gunghyez youqgaenj saedhengz 24 siujseiz gwnz vangj gamguenj, saedbauj gamguenj caetliengh.",
        "zh": "对所有重点工业污染源实行24小时在线监控，确保监控质量。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mingzbeg doekdingh gij seizhanh aen giyez baizcuengq mbouj dabdaengz biucinj de gatsat dabdaengz biucinj, daengz geiz mbouj dabdaengz biucinj ne giengiet ciuqfap gvendingz bae.",
        "zh": "明确排放不达标企业最后达标时限，到期不达标的坚决依法关停。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Sam aeu gyagiengz ceihleix gij heiq rieng ci gihdungceh.",
        "zh": "三要强化机动车尾气治理。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daihdaej raengcawz cimaihenj, gyavaiq raengcawz gihdungceh gaeuq, cienhangh cingjceih gij ci gihdungceh baizcuengq lai de, gikcoi sawjyungh gij ci yungh nwngzyenz seuq.",
        "zh": "基本淘汰黄标车，加快淘汰老旧机动车，对高排放机动车进行专项整治，鼓励使用清洁能源汽车。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daezsang yenzyouz binjcaet, youq dieg youqgaenj de gyavaiq doigvangq sawjyungh cungj youz guekroek biucinj.",
        "zh": "提高燃油品质，在重点区域加快推广使用国六标准燃油。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Seiq aeu mizyauq wngqdoiq dienheiq uqlah youqgaenj.",
        "zh": "四要有效应对重污染天气。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyagiengz yenzgiu gij goekgaen daihheiq uqlah caeuq mokfaenx baenzlawz cauhbaenz, lai rox gohyoz caeuq cingcinj bae wngqdoiq.",
        "zh": "加强对大气污染的源解析和雾霾形成机理研究，提高应对的科学性和精准性。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyadaih aen gvaengh lienzhab fuengzre、gaemhanh、ceihleix dieg cungdenj, giengzvaq gij guhfap yawhgingj caeuq wngqgip.",
        "zh": "扩大重点区域联防联控范围，强化预警和应急措施。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Haj aeu dawzyiemz vanzging caepfap caeuq dukcaz gyaepdawz cwzyin.",
        "zh": "五要严格环境执法和督查问责。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doiq boux caeg baizcuengq、cauhgyaj de, bietdingh aeu ciuqfap fadceih; doiq boux dawzfap mbouj daeklig、soeng'yungz mbouj haed de, bietdingh aeu yiemzsuk cazdawz cwzyin; doiq hoengheiq caetliengh bienq rwix、wngqdoiq mbouj daeklig ne, bietdingh aeu yiemzyiemz cazdawz cwzyin.",
        "zh": "对偷排、造假的，必须依法惩治；对执法不力、姑息纵容的，必须严肃追究；对空气质量恶化、应对不力的，必须严格问责。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ceihleix mokfaenx bouxboux miz cwzyin, ceiq youqgaenj dwg hengzdoengh, genhciz couh ndaej guhbaenz.",
        "zh": "治理雾霾人人有责，贵在行动、成在坚持。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daengx biengz mboujduenh roengzrengz, ngoenz mbwnlamz couh itdingh ndaej bi beij bi lai.",
        "zh": "全社会不懈努力，蓝天必定会一年比一年多起来。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyagiengz fuengzceih raemx、namh uqlah.",
        "zh": "强化水、土壤污染防治。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bineix vayoz yungh yangj soqliengh、anhdan baizcuengq soqliengh aeu faenbied doekdaemq 2%.",
        "zh": "今年化学需氧量、氨氮排放量要分别下降2%。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ca ndei fuengzceih gij raemx uqlah cungdenj liuzyiz、fueng dieg、ndaw haij caeuq gij uqlah doenggvaq raemx cienz hawj nungzyez de.",
        "zh": "抓好重点流域、区域、海域水污染和农业面源污染防治。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ciengzsaeq cazcing namh uqlah, faenloih ceiqdingh saedhengz gij guhfap ceihleix.",
        "zh": "开展土壤污染详查，分类制定实施治理措施。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyagiengz gyoebhab cingjceih gij vanzging singz mbanj, daiqdaeuz dizcang gij gwndaenj fuengsik saekloeg, gizgiz cungj doihengz aen cidu faenloih nyapnyaj.",
        "zh": "加强城乡环境综合整治，倡导绿色生活方式，普遍推行垃圾分类制度。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gungganq guhhung aen canjnieb mbaet nwngzyenz vanzbauj, fazcanj gij canjnieb saekloeg caiq cauhguh caeuq sinzvanz leihyungh swhyenz, sawj vanzging gaijndei caeuq ginghci fazcanj saedyienh caez ndaej ndeicawq.",
        "zh": "培育壮大节能环保产业，发展绿色再制造和资源循环利用产业，使环境改善与经济发展实现双赢。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doicaenh baujhoh caeuq cauhlaeb swnghdai.",
        "zh": "推进生态保护和建设。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cagaenj vehdingh caemhcaiq yiemzsouj diuz sienqhoengz baujhoh swnghdai.",
        "zh": "抓紧划定并严守生态保护红线。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gaenxmaenx wngqdoiq dienheiq bienqvaq.",
        "zh": "积极应对气候变化。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Hai guh gij sawqdiemj doengh aen gunghcwngz daezswng ndoengfaex caetliengh、coihfuk gij swnghdai hungnaek rangh ginghci Dahcangzgyangh、daihngeih buek baujhoh bya raemx ndoeng naz huz swnghdai, guhbaenz doiq geng ndaem faex ndaem nywj 1200 fanh moux doxhwnj, gyagiengz ceihleix dieg bienq sa bienq fwz、dieg bienq rin, cwkrom gij cienzcaiz swnghdai engq lai, cauhlaeb diuz ciengzsingz saekloeg ndaej lienzdaemh fazcanj.",
        "zh": "启动森林质量提升、长江经济带重大生态修复、第二批山水林田湖生态保护工程试点，完成退耕还林还草1200万亩以上，加强荒漠化、石漠化治理，积累更多生态财富，构筑可持续发展的绿色长城。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "（Bet）Doicaenh gij sevei gensez aeu baujcang caeuq gaijndei beksingq gwndaenj guh cungdenj.",
        "zh": "（八）推进以保障和改善民生为重点的社会建设。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Beksingq gwndaenj dwg gij saeh ceiq youqgaenj guh goengsaeh, bietdingh aeu seizseiz cuengq youq ndaw sim、gwed youq gwnz mbaq.",
        "zh": "民生是为政之要，必须时刻放在心头、扛在肩上。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Seizneix, ndaw guek rog guek hingzseiq yiemzhaenq fukcab, engq aeu sien baujcang caeuq gaijndei beksingq gwndaenj gonq, gij saehsaed hab guh de aeu caenhrengz guh ndei, diuz daejsienq beksingq gwndaenj aeu giengiet soujmaenh.",
        "zh": "在当前国内外形势严峻复杂的情况下，更要优先保障和改善民生，该办能办的实事要竭力办好，基本民生的底线要坚决兜牢。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daihlig coicaenh couhnieb cauhnieb.",
        "zh": "大力促进就业创业。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laebndei couhnieb cwngcwz, gyarengz bae beizyin couhnieb, gyagiengz haeujcoengh lingzvued couhnieb、couhnieb yienghmoq.",
        "zh": "完善就业政策，加大就业培训力度，加强对灵活就业、新就业形态的支持。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bineix gauhyau bizyezswngh 795 fanh vunz, dwg gwnz lizsij bi ceiq lai, aeu saedhengz ndei aen giva coicaenh couhnieb、dazyinx cauhnieb、caengzdaej cingzsug daengj, coicaenh lai diuz miengloh couhnieb cauhnieb.",
        "zh": "今年高校毕业生795万人，再创历史新高，要实施好就业促进、创业引领、基层成长等计划，促进多渠道就业创业。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doeksaed caeuq laebndei cwngcwz, cietsaed guhndei gij hong anceiq bouxbing doiqok doihbing.",
        "zh": "落实和完善政策，切实做好退役军人安置工作。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyarengz bangcoengh couhnieb, fuzrex gij vunz hojnanz hawsingz、gij vunz ndangcanz couhnieb, saedbauj aen gyadingz fouz vunz couhnieb de ceiqnoix miz boux ndeu couhnieb onjdingh.",
        "zh": "加大就业援助力度，扶持城镇困难人员、残疾人就业，确保零就业家庭至少有一人稳定就业。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raeuz bietdingh aeu dawzmaenh couhnieb aen goek beksingq gwndaenj neix, hawj gyoengqvunz youq ndaw guhhong cauh ok cienzcaiz, youq ndaw haenqguh saedyienh gyaciz seiqvunz.",
        "zh": "我们必须牢牢抓住就业这一民生之本，让人们在劳动中创造财富，在奋斗中实现人生价值。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Banh ndei gij gyauyuz goengbingz caetliengh ndei de.",
        "zh": "办好公平优质教育。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doengjit gij cwngcwz hawsingz lajmbanj mboengq yivu gyauyuz hagseng \"song mienx it bouj\", gyavaiq hawj yivu gyauyuz goenggungh fugsaeh cwgoemq daengz gyoengq vunz ciengzseiz youq hawsingz, laebdaeb gaijndei gij banhhag diuzgen hagdangz mbangnyieg, hawj gij gyauyuz swhyenz caetliengh ndei haenx guenj ndaej engq gvangq, mboujduenh sukiq singz mbanj、gak dieg、gak hagdangz banhhag cengca.",
        "zh": "统一城乡义务教育学生“两免一补”政策，加快实现城镇义务教育公共服务常住人口全覆盖，持续改善薄弱学校办学条件，扩大优质教育资源覆盖面，不断缩小城乡、区域、校际办学差距。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laebdaeb gyahung gij gveihmoz cungdenj gauhyau yiengq dieg gungzhoj lajmbanj ciu hagseng.",
        "zh": "继续扩大重点高校面向贫困地区农村招生规模。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daezsang gij biucinj cienzngaenz guekgya bangbouj bozsw yenzgiuswngh.",
        "zh": "提高博士研究生国家助学金补助标准。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doicaenh hwnqguh gij daihhag caeuq yozgoh baiz youq gwnz seiqgyaiq baiz daih'it de.",
        "zh": "推进世界一流大学和一流学科建设。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laebdaeb doidoengh bouhfaenh bwnjgoh gauhyau cienjbienq baenz wngqyungh loihhingz.",
        "zh": "继续推动部分本科高校向应用型转变。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyalaeg gij sawqdiemj gauhgauj gyoebhab gaijgwz.",
        "zh": "深化高考综合改革试点。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
