        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Baujciz aeu yiengh rengzhaenq daeuj ceihfad baihrwix, gyoebcomz youq cungdenj lingjyiz, yiemzsuk cazbanh gij fungheiq mbouj cingq ciemqhaih leih'ik cungqvunz caeuq vwndiz baihrwix.",
        "zh": "保持惩治腐败高压态势，聚焦重点领域，严肃查处侵害群众利益的不正之风和腐败问题。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyoengq gunghvuyenz aeu bauj seuq dawz cingq, fwngz seuq ndang cingq bang beksingq guh saeh.",
        "zh": "广大公务员要持廉守正，干干净净为人民做事。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
