        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laebndei gij gihci gikcoi caeuq gij gihci cinjhawj sawq loek gaij loek, gikcoi boux guhsaeh gyarengz, bang boux gamj guh cengjhwet.",
        "zh": "健全激励机制和容错纠错机制，给干事者鼓劲，为担当者撑腰。",
