        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Hawj haij mbwn bienfuengz guenjhaed engq ak, coumaed cujciz doengh gij hengzdoengh youqgaenj fanj gungjbu hen onjdingh、gozci hen huz、haij gyae hohsoengq ruz baedauq daengj.",
        "zh": "强化海空边防管控，周密组织反恐维稳、国际维和、远海护航等重要行动。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daezsang gij naengzlig gozfangz gohgi gag guhcawj cauhmoq, gyavaiq gensez yienhdaih houginz caeuq fazcanj cangboiq.",
        "zh": "提高国防科技自主创新能力，加快现代后勤建设和装备发展。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyagiengz cienzminz gozfangz gyauyuz、gozfangz dungyenz caeuq cauhlaeb ligliengh bwhlaeng.",
