        "zh": "加大网络提速降费力度，实现高速宽带城乡全覆盖，扩大公共场所免费上网范围，明显降低家庭宽带、企业宽带和专线使用费，取消流量“漫游”费，移动网络流量资费年内至少降低30%，让群众和企业切实受益，为数字中国建设加油助力。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyavaiq cauhlaeb aen guek ak dajcauh.",
        "zh": "加快制造强国建设。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doidoengh canjnieb hwngfat, lumjbaenz cizcwngz denlu、yizdung doengsaenq daih daihhaj、fazdunggih feihgih、giceh nwngzyenz moq、caizliuh moq daengj, hengzguh aen gunghcwngz cienhangh cangboiq hothoh mbangnyieg youqgaenj, hwngfat aen bingzdaiz gunghyez vangjdoxlienz, cauhlaeb giz dieg yienghndei\"Cungguek Dajcauh 2025\".",
        "zh": "推动集成电路、第五代移动通信、飞机发动机、新能源汽车、新材料等产业发展，实施重大短板装备专项工程，发展工业互联网平台，创建“中国制造2025”示范区。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daihliengh gemjnoix mbaw cingq cinjhawj gunghyez swnghcanj, gyagiengz gamguenj canjbinj caetliengh.",
        "zh": "大幅压减工业生产许可证，强化产品质量监管。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cienzmienh mbeguh aen hengzdoengh daezswng caetliengh, doicaenh caeuq gij senhcin suijbingz gozci doiqciuq biucinj dabdaengz biucinj, fatyiengz gij cingsaenz boux yienghndei gaenxguh caeuq gij cingsaenz lauxcangh, cauhlaeb aen doih guhhong miz dungxcaiz、dinfwngz raeh、ak cauhmoq, guh ciengz binjcaet gwzming Cungguek dajcauh.",
        "zh": "全面开展质量提升行动，推进与国际先进水平对标达标，弘扬工匠精神，来一场中国制造的品质革命。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laebdaeb buqcawz gij gunghawj fouzyauq de.",
        "zh": "继续破除无效供给。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Genhciz yungh gij soujduenh hawciengz fapceih, dawzyiemz caephengz gij fapgvi biucinj vanzbauj、caetliengh、ancienz daengj, vaqgej gij swnghcanj naengzlig laiyawz、raengcawz gij swnghcanj naengzlig doeklaeng de.",
        "zh": "坚持用市场化法治化手段，严格执行环保、质量、安全等法规标准，化解过剩产能、淘汰落后产能。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bineix caiq gemjnoix gangdiet swnghcanj naengzlig 3000 fanh dunh baedauq, doiqok meizdan swnghcanj naengzlig 1.5 ik dunh baedauq, raengcawz gven dingz gij meizden gihcuj 30 fanh cienvaj doxroengz mbouj hab biucinj de.",
        "zh": "今年再压减钢铁产能3000万吨左右，退出煤炭产能1.5亿吨左右，淘汰关停不达标的30万千瓦以下煤电机组。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gya rengz buqcanj cingsuenq caeuq dauqcungz cingjhab \"aen giyez daigyaengj\", anceiq ndei cizgungh caeuq cawqleix ndei dawzcaiq.",
        "zh": "加大“僵尸企业”破产清算和重整力度，做好职工安置和债务处置。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gemjnoix gij gunghawj fouzyauq de aeu guh ok cingzyauq moq daeuj.",
        "zh": "减少无效供给要抓出新成效。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyalaeg bae gaijgwz\"cuengqgienz guenjleix fugsaeh\".",
        "zh": "深化“放管服”改革。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cienzmienh hengzguh gij cidu mbawdan gimq guh cinjhaeuj hawciengz daengx guek doengjit.",
        "zh": "全面实施市场准入负面清单制度。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Youq daengx guek haiguh gij gaijgwz\"cwnggen cizcau faenliz\", cungdenj dwg miz cizcau le gemj yungh cwnggen, gak loih cwnggen ndaej gemj caenhliengh gemj、ndaej doxhab couh doxhab, caiq atsuk seizgan haibanh giyez.",
        "zh": "在全国推开“证照分离”改革，重点是照后减证，各类证能减尽减、能合则合，进一步压缩企业开办时间。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daih fukdoh sukgemj aen cougeiz cucwz sanghbyauh.ij seizgan saemjbae gunghcwngz hanghmoeg de caiq gemjnoix dingz ndeu.",
        "zh": "大幅缩短商标注册周期。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cienzmienh hengzguh yiengh gamguenj\"song seizbienh coucaz、it goenghai\", baenzlawz cungj mbouj hawj gyaj、mauh、rwix、yaez fatmaj baihraih, baenzlawz cungj mbouj hawj bouxcaepfap gwn、lab、gaz、aeu.",
        "zh": "工程建设项目审批时间再压减一半。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Haeujlaeg bae doicaenh\"vangjdoxlienz ＋ cwngvu fugsaeh\", hawj youq gwnz vangj banhleix saehhangh engq lai, gij itdingh aeu daengz ciengz banh de hix aeu caenhrengz guhdaengz\"dan haeuj aen dou ndeu\"、\"ceiq lai buet mbat ndeu\".",
        "zh": "全面实施“双随机、一公开”监管，决不允许假冒伪劣滋生蔓延，决不允许执法者吃拿卡要。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyagiengz cauhlaeb cwngvu fugsaeh baenz biucinj bae.",
        "zh": "深入推进“互联网+政务服务”，使更多事项在网上办理，必须到现场办的也要力争做到“只进一扇门”、“最多跑一次”。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Haenqrengz doicaenh gaijgwz aen gihci gyoebhab caepfap gihgou, comzrengz gaijgez aen vwndiz lai gyaeuj lai caengz cungzfuk caepfap.",
        "zh": "大力推进综合执法机构机制改革，着力解决多头多层重复执法问题。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyavaiq cwngfuj saenqsik hidungj dox lienz dox doeng, dwkdoeng aen dauj saenqsik godog.",
        "zh": "加快政府信息系统互联互通，打通信息孤岛。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cingleix gak cungj cwngmingz banhsaeh cungqvunz caeuq giyez, gij mbouj miz faplwd fapgvi gaengawq de aeu siu caez bae.",
        "zh": "清理群众和企业办事的各类证明，没有法律法规依据的一律取消。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Hawj vanzging guh seng'eiq bienq ndei couh dwg gejcuengq swnghcanjliz、daezsang naengzlig beijak, aeu buqcawz gazngaih、siucawz fanzcab、cukmaenh roen bingz, demgiengz rengzhoengh hawj hawciengz cawjdaej, demgya fuengbienh hawj cungqvunz lwgminz.",
        "zh": "优化营商环境就是解放生产力、提高竞争力，要破障碍、去烦苛、筑坦途，为市场主体添活力，为人民群众增便利。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Caiq gemjmbaeu gij gvaeh giyez.",
        "zh": "进一步减轻企业税负。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gaijgwz laebndei cwnghcizsui, ciuq aen fuengyiengq sam dangj gyoebbaenz song dangj bae diuzcingj suiqlwd suijbingz, cungdenj gyangqdaemq gij suiqlwd hangznieb dajcauh、hangznieb daehyinh daengj, daezsang aen biucinj daengxbi siugai soqngeg bouxnabgvaeh gveihmoz iq de.",
        "zh": "改革完善增值税，按照三档并两档方向调整税率水平，重点降低制造业、交通运输等行业税率，提高小规模纳税人年销售额标准。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daih fukdoh gya'gvangq aen gvaengh giyez iq saeq yiengjsouh aen cwngcwz gemj buenq cwngsou sojdwzsui.",
