    {
        "zhuang": "Daih fukdoh daezsang aen soq ceiq sang gaeucawz nabgvaeh gaxgonq giyez cawx yizgi sezbei moq.",
        "zh": "大幅提高企业新购入仪器设备税前扣除上限。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Saedhengz aen cwngcwz gyoebgyonj dingj mienx giyez youq rogguek canh ndaej.",
        "zh": "实施企业境外所得综合抵免政策。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gya'gvangq aen gvaengh cienzgvaeh youhvei yiengh diegdeih vuzliuz giyez cuengq huq.",
        "zh": "扩大物流企业仓储用地税收优惠范围。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laebdaeb hengzguh gij cwngcwz daengz geiz youhvei yiengh diegdeih cwnghcizsui、gisui aen giyez cungzcuj.",
        "zh": "继续实施企业重组土地增值税、契税等到期优惠政策。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daengxbi caiq doiq giyez caeuq goyinz gemjgvaeh 8000 lai ik maenz, coicaenh saeddaej ginghci cienjhingz swnggaep, haenqrengz gikfat gij rengzhoengh hawciengz caeuq gij naengzlig aenbiengz dajcauh.",
        "zh": "全年再为企业和个人减税8000多亿元，促进实体经济转型升级，着力激发市场活力和社会创造力。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daih fukdoh gemjmbaeu diuzrap mbouj dwg gvaehsuiq giyez.",
        "zh": "大幅降低企业非税负担。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Caiq cingleix gveihfan gij soucienz hingzcwng saehnieb singqcaet, diuzdaemq aen biucinj mbangj cwngfujsing gihginh cwngsou.",
        "zh": "进一步清理规范行政事业性收费，调低部分政府性基金征收标准。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laebdaeb guh duenh gyangqdaemq gij beijlaeh giyez gyaucienz\"haj yiemj it ginh\".",
        "zh": "继续阶段性降低企业“五险一金”缴费比例。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyangqdaemq gij soucienz hothoh denvangj caeuq gij gyaqcienz soengq dienh boiq dienh, bingzyaenz gyangqdaemq gij gyaqdienh itbuen gunghsanghyez 10％.",
        "zh": "降低电网环节收费和输配电价格，一般工商业电价平均降低10%。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyalaeg gaijgwz gij cidu goengloh soucienz, gyangqdaemq gij cienz gvaq roen gvaq giuz.",
        "zh": "深化收费公路制度改革，降低过路过桥费用。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gya rengz cingleix cingjdun cunghgai fugsaeh soucienz.",
        "zh": "加大中介服务收费清理整顿力度。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daengxbi aeu bang hawciengz cawjdaej gemjmbaeu diuzrap mbouj dwg gvaehsuiq de 3000 lai ik maenz, gij mbouj hableix de genhgez siubae, gij sang lai de genhgez gyangq roengzdaeuj. Hawj giyez ndaej ndang mbaeu bae guh、comzrengz hwngfat.",
        "zh": "全年要为市场主体减轻非税负担3000多亿元，不合理的坚决取消，过高的坚决降下来，让企业轻装上阵、聚力发展。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "（Ngeih）Gyavaiq cauhlaeb aen guekgya cauhmoq.",
        "zh": "（二）加快建设创新型国家。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dawzmaenh aen daihseiq seiqgyaiq lwnz moq gohgi gwzming caeuq canjnieb bengwz, haeujlaeg hengzguh aen canloz aeu cauhmoq doinyoengx hwngfat, mboujduenh gya ak gij naengzlig cauhmoq caeuq gij naengzlig beijak ginghci.",
        "zh": "把握世界新一轮科技革命和产业变革大势，深入实施创新驱动发展战略，不断增强经济创新力和竞争力。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyagiengz cauhlaeb aen dijhi cauhmoq guekgya.",
        "zh": "加强国家创新体系建设。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gya rengz guh gihcuj yenzgiu、wngqyungh gihcuj yenzgiu caeuq baeznduj cauhmoq, doenghfwngz guh buek hanghmoeg hungnaek gohgi cauhmoq ndeu, ciuq biucinj sang bae hwnqguh aen sizyensiz guekgya.",
        "zh": "强化基础研究和应用基础研究，启动一批科技创新重大项目，高标准建设国家实验室。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gikcoi giyez yiendaeuz guh gohgi hanghmoeg hungnaek, daemxcengj gohyenz yensoj、gauhyau caeuq giyez yungzdoeng cauhmoq, gyavaiq cienjvaq wngqyungh gij cwngzgoj cauhmoq.",
        "zh": "鼓励企业牵头实施重大科技项目，支持科研院所、高校与企业融通创新，加快创新成果转化应用。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Guekgya gohgi douzhaeuj aeu ngeng coh aen lingjyiz minzswngh, lai roengzrengz yenzgiu ceihleix mokfaenx, doicaenh gungroengz aen nanzgvan fuengz yw bingh hung bingh naek lumjbaenz bingh'aizcwng daengj, sawj gohgi engq ndei bae cauhfuk hawj lwgminz.",
        "zh": "国家科技投入要向民生领域倾斜，加强雾霾治理、癌症等重大疾病防治攻关，使科技更好造福人民。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doeksaed caeuq laebndei gij cwngcwz gikcoi cauhmoq.",
        "zh": "落实和完善创新激励政策。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gaijgwz aen cidu guenjleix gohgi, bingzgyaq gij cikyauq hanghmoeg gohyenz aeu gyavaiq daj yawjnaek bouhloh cienj yiengq yawjnaek gezgoj.",
        "zh": "改革科技管理制度，绩效评价要加快从重过程向重结果转变。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Hawj aen doih caeuq vunzcaiz lingxdaeuz cauhmoq miz gienz engq lai, miz gienz guenj vunz、cienz、huq caeuq gietdingh gisuz lohsienq.",
        "zh": "赋予创新团队和领军人才更大的人财物支配权和技术路线决策权。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doiq boux guh gohyenz rapdawz gohgi gunggvan yinvu hungnaek de, yungh gij cidu cienzhong caeuq banhfap dajciengj lingzvued haenx.",
        "zh": "对承担重大科技攻关任务的科研人员，采取灵活的薪酬制度和奖励措施。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Damqra gij fuengfap hawj boux guh hong gohyenz miz gienz gaemmiz caeuq miz gienz ciengzgeiz sawjyungh gohgi cwngzgoj.",
        "zh": "探索赋予科研人员科技成果所有权和长期使用权。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij gvidingh gvicieng gaeuqgeq caeuq gij cwngcwz gikcoi cauhmoq mbouj doxhab de, aeu cagaenj coihgaij feiqcawz bae； gij saehhangh laiyawz gazngaih sanqfat rengzhoengh cauhmoq de, aeu genhgez vuetvak bae.",
        "zh": "有悖于激励创新的陈规旧章，要抓紧修改废止；有碍于释放创新活力的繁文缛节，要下决心砍掉。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Coicaenh vunzlai cauhnieb、vunzlai cauhmoq guh ndaej miz suijbingz.",
        "zh": "促进大众创业、万众创新上水平。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Guek raeuz miz gij swhyenz rengzvunz gwnz seiqgyaiq ceiq lai. Neix dwg gij \"gvangq fouq\" ceiq daih cauhmoq hwngfat.",
        "zh": "我国拥有世界上规模最大的人力人才资源，这是创新发展的最大“富矿”。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeu daezhawj cienz fueng'vih fugsaeh cauhmoq cauhnieb, doicaenh hwnqguh dieg yienghndei\"song cauh\", gikcoi giyez hung、gauhyau caeuq gohyenz yensoj hailangh gak loih swhyenz cauhmoq, hwngfat gij ginghci bingzdaiz、ginghci caemhmiz, guhbaenz aen gapgyaq geksik cauhmoq cauhnieb gwnz sienq laj sienq giethab、canj yoz yenz yungh doxdaengh、giyez hung rauh iq yungzhab, dajcauh banj swnggaep\"song cauh\".",
        "zh": "要提供全方位创新创业服务，推进“双创”示范基地建设，鼓励大企业、高校和科研院所开放创新资源，发展平台经济、共享经济，形成线上线下结合、产学研用协同、大中小企业融合的创新创业格局，打造“双创”升级版。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndalaeb Guekgya Yungzswh Danhbauj Gihginh, daemxcengj loih giyez cauhmoq ndei de fathengz gujbyau yungzswh, dawz aen gvaengh sawqguh diuz cwngcwz youhvei cienzgvaeh hawj cauhnieb douzswh、denhsij douzswh haenx gya'gvangq daengz daengx guek.",
        "zh": "设立国家融资担保基金，支持优质创新型企业上市融资，将创业投资、天使投资税收优惠政策试点范围扩大到全国。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeu gyalaeg gaijgwz aen dijci vunzcaiz hwngfat, doidoengh swhyenz rengzvunz miz bouhloh riuzdoengh mbouj deng hanhhaed, daemxcengj giyez daezsang gij cienzhong fukleih boux gisuz gunghyinz, gyagiengz dajciengj gij vunzcaiz ginwngz sang de, gikcoi boux bae rog guek doegsaw dauqma guekcoj cauhmoq cauhnieb, haigvangq diuzroen loegsaek hawj vunzcaiz rog guek daeuj Cungguek.",
        "zh": "深化人才发展体制改革，推动人力资源自由流动，支持企业提高技术工人待遇，加大高技能人才激励，鼓励海外留学人员回国创新创业，拓宽外国人才来华绿色通道。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeu comz gij coengmingz、ligliengh cungqvunz, itdingh ndaej buet ok yiengh Cungguek cauhmoq\"gya vaiq\" daeuj.",
        "zh": "集众智汇众力，一定能跑出中国创新“加速度”。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "（Sam）Gyalaeg gaijgwz aen lingjyiz dwg giekdaej ceiq youqgaenj de.",
        "zh": "（三）深化基础性关健领域改革。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Swnh aen seizndei gaijgwz hailangh 40 hopbi, doidoengh gaijgwz aeundaej cungbyoengq moq, mboujduenh gejcuengq caeuq hwngfat swnghcanjliz ndawbiengz.",
        "zh": "以改革开放40周年为重要契机，推动改革取得新突破，不断解放和发展社会生产力。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doicaenh gaijgwz swhcanj guekmiz、giyez guekmiz.",
        "zh": "推进国资国企改革。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ceiqdingh mbawdan gienzleih、cwzyin、gamguenj bouxokcienz.",
        "zh": "制定出资人监管权责清单。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyalaeg giz sawqguh gaijgwz lumjbaenz swhbwnj guekmiz douzswh、ginghyingz guenjleix gunghswh daengj, hawj gij gienz gag guhcawj engq lai.",
        "zh": "深化国有资本投资、运营公司等改革试点，赋予更多自主权。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laebdaeb doicaenh giyez guekmiz bienqndei cungzcuj caeuq giyez cunghyangh gaijbaenz gujfwn gunghswh bae, gyavaiq cauxbaenz aen gapgyaq fazyinz ceihleix hanhhaed mizyauq caeuq aen gihci hawciengz ginghyingz lingzvued yauqlwd sang de, laebdaeb bienq ndang reux miz rengz bae, daezswng gij naengzlig beijak haedsim goeknieb, doidoengh swhbwnj guekmiz guh ak guh ndei guh hung.",
        "zh": "继续推进国有企业优化重组和央企股份制改革，加快形成有效制衡的法人治理结构和灵活高效的市场化经营机制，持续瘦身健体，提升主业核心竞争力，推动国有资本做强做优做大。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Onjmaenh doicaenh gaijgwz gij sojyoujci doxgyaux.",
        "zh": "稳妥推进混合所有制改革。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doeksaed aen cidu yiengq Daengx Guek Yinzda Cangzveijvei bauq gij cingzgvang guenjleix swhcanj guekmiz.",
        "zh": "落实向全国人大常委会报告国有资产管理情况的制度。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Giyez guekmiz aeu doenggvaq gaijgwz cauhmoq, byaij youq baizgonq hwngfat caetliengh sang.",
        "zh": "国有企业要通过改革创新，走在高质量发展前列。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daemxcengj giyez minzyingz hwngfat.",
        "zh": "支持民营企业发展。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Genhciz\"song aen ngauz mbouj doengh saek di\", genhciz gienzleih bingzdaengj、gihvei bingzdaengj、gveihcwz bingzdaengj, cienzmienh doeksaed gij cwngcwz guhfap daemxcengj yiengh ginghci mbouj dwg gunghyoujci de hwngfat, nyinhcaen gaijgez gij vwndiz doedyienh giyez minzyingz fanjyingj de, genhgez buqcawz gak cungj laengzgaz ndumjndaw.",
        "zh": "坚持“两个毫不动摇”，坚持权利平等、机会平等、规则平等，全面落实支持非公有制经济发展的政策措施，认真解决民营企业反映的突出问题，坚决破除各种隐性壁垒。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cauhlaeb cungj gvanhaeh cwng sangh yienghmoq caengaenh cingseuq, laebndei aen gihci hawj giyezgyah caeuqfaenh ceiqdingh gij cwngcwz nangqdaengz giyez.",
        "zh": "构建亲清新型政商关系，健全企业家参与涉企政策制定机制。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gikfat caeuq baujhoh gij cingsaenz giyezgyah, hawj giyezgyah engq miz saenqsim, hawj giyez minzyingz youq ndaw rumzlangh hawciengz ginghci foux yungh bonjsaeh.",
        "zh": "激发和保护企业家精神，增强企业家信心，让民营企业在市场经济浪潮中尽显身手。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laebndei aen cidu canjgienz caeuq aen gihci hawciengz gietdingh gij gyaqcienz yausu.",
        "zh": "完善产权制度和要素市场化配置机制。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Canjgienz cidu dwg ndaek ringiek hawciengz ginghci sevei cujyi.",
        "zh": "产权制度是社会主义市场经济的基石。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yaek aeu baujhoh canjgienz、henhoh iekdingh、doengjit hawciengz、bingzdaengj doxvuenh、goengbingz beijak guh goek dazyinx fuengyiengq, laebndei faplwd fapgvi doxgven.",
        "zh": "要以保护产权、维护契约、统一市场、平等交换、公平竞争为基本导向，完善相关法律法规。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doiq gak cungj hingzveiz ciemqgienz aeu eifap yiemzsuk cawqleix, doiq gij anqgienh canjgienz cengnauh cingjgouz dauqsaemj de aeu eifap cazcing niujcingq bae.",
        "zh": "对各种侵权行为要依法严肃处理，对产权纠纷案件要依法甄别纠正。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyagiengz baujhoh cihsiz canjgienz, saedhengz aen cidu dienzboiz ciemqgienz hawj boux ciemqgienz hit bae.",
        "zh": "强化知识产权保护，实行侵权惩罚性赔偿制度。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyavaiq gaijgwz hawj gisuz、diegdeih daengj yausu youz hawciengz dinghgyaq, gyalaeg gaijgwz gij gyaqcienz loih canjbinj swhyenz caeuq goenggungh fugsaeh, dwkbyoengq hingzcwng gagciemq, fuengzre gagciemq hawciengz.",
        "zh": "加快技术、土地等要素价格市场化改革，深化资源类产品和公共服务价格改革，打破行政垄断，防止市场垄断。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeu yungh gij canjgienz baujhoh miz rengz、yausu riuzdoengh doengrat de, hawj rengzhoengh hawciengz caeuq naengzlig dajcauh ndawbiengz doxcanj biufat okdaeuj.",
        "zh": "要用有力的产权保护、顺畅的要素流动，让市场活力和社会创造力竞相迸发。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyalaeg gaijgwz aen dijci caizsui.",
        "zh": "深化财税体制改革。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doicaenh gaijgwz vehfaen gij caizcwng saehgienz caeuq ceiok cwzyin cunghyangh nem deihfueng, cagaenj ceiqdingh aen fueng'anq gaijgwz vehfaen souhaeuj, laebndei aen cidu cienjok ceihawj.",
        "zh": "推进中央与地方财政事权和支出责任划分改革，抓紧制定收入划分改革方案，完善转移支付制度。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laebndei aen dijhi cienzgvaeh deihfueng, onjmaenh bae doicaenh laeb aen fap cienzgvaeh fangzdicanj.",
        "zh": "健全地方税体系，稳妥推进房地产税立法。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gaijgwz goyinz sojdwzsui.",
        "zh": "改革个人所得税。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cienzmienh hengzguh cikyauq guenjleix, sawj gij cienzngaenz caizcwng yungh deng giz ngamj、yungh ndaej ancienz.",
        "zh": "全面实施绩效管理，使财政资金花得其所、用得安全。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyavaiq gaijgwz aen dijci ginhyungz.",
        "zh": "加快金融体制改革。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gaijgwz guhndei aen dijhi ginhyungz fugsaeh, daemxcengj ginhyungz gihgou haigvangq gij ginhyungz yezvu hawj ndeicawq mienh gvangq, gveihfan hwngfat aen ginhyungz gihgou rauh iq deihfueng, comzrengz gaijgez aen vwndiz giyez iq saeq yungzswh nanz、yungzswh bengz.",
        "zh": "改革完善金融服务体系，支持金融机构扩展普惠金融业务，规范发展地方性中小金融机构，着力解决小微企业融资难、融资贵问题。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyalaeg gaijgwz aen hawciengz swhbwnj lai caengz lai mbaek, doidoengh aen hawciengz caigen、geizhoq hwngfat.",
        "zh": "深化多层次资本市场改革，推动债券、期货市场发展。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyahung cungj goengnaengz baujcang gij fungyiemj baujyiemj hawciengz.",
        "zh": "拓展保险市场的风险保障功能。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyalaeg gaijgwz, hawj leihlwd veiqlwd youz hawciengz daeuj dingh, baujciz gij veiqlwd yinzminzbi daihdaej onjdingh youq gwnz suijbingz hableix doxdaengh.",
        "zh": "深化利率汇率市场化改革，保持人民币汇率在合理均衡水平上的基本稳定。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doicaenh gaijgwz dijci ndawbiengz.",
        "zh": "推进社会体制改革。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyalaeg gaijgwz cungj cidu ciengxlaux baujyiemj, laebhwnj aen cidu cunghyangh diuzbouj giyez cizgungh gihbwnj ciengxlaux baujyiemj gihginh.",
        "zh": "深化养老保险制度改革，建立企业职工基本养老保险基金中央调剂制度。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyalaeg gyoebhab gaijgwz yihyen goenglaeb, doxdaengh doicaenh gaijgwz gyaqcienz ywbingh、cienzhong vunzsaeh、gijyw riuzdoeng、yihbauj ceihawj, daezsang gij caetliengh yihliuz veiswngh fugsaeh, roengz rengz hung gaijgez aen nanzdaez cungqvunz hoj yawjbingh hoj ywbingh.",
        "zh": "深化公立医院综合改革，协调推进医疗价格、人事薪酬、药品流通、医保支付改革，提高医疗卫生服务质量，下大力气解决群众看病就医难题。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Haeujlaeg doicaenh gaijgwz gyauyuz、vwnzva、dijyuz daengj, caenhliengh sanqfat gij rengzndumj hwngfat hungloet ndawbiengz.",
        "zh": "深入推进教育、文化、体育等改革，充分释放社会领域巨大发展潜力。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laebndei aen dijci swnghdai vwnzmingz.",
        "zh": "健全生态文明体制。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gaijgwz laebndei aen cidu guenjleix swnghdai vanzging, gyagiengz gaemguenj baenzlawz yungh swyenz swnghdai hoenggan, doihengz aen cidu dienzboiz sonjhaih swnghdai vanzging, laebndei aen gihci dienzbouj swnghdai, yungh gij cidu engqgya mizyauq bae baujhoh swnghdai vanzging.",
        "zh": "改革完善生态环境管理制度，加强自然生态空间用途管制，推行生态环境损害赔偿制度，完善生态补偿机制，以更加有效的制度保护生态环境。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "（Seiq）Genhgez guhndei sam daih hongsaeh ceiq hoj guh haenx.",
        "zh": "（四）坚决打好三大攻坚战。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeu hopheux guhbaenz gij yinvu gunggeng daengxbi, mingzbeg doekdingh gij cwzyin gak fueng, giengzvaq cwngcwz baujcang, guh saed guh ndei gak hangh hong.",
        "zh": "要围绕完成年度攻坚任务，明确各方责任，强化政策保障，把各项工作做实做好。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doidoengh fuengzre vaqgej fungyiemj hungnaek yamq baenaj yienhda.",
        "zh": "推动重大风险防范化解取得明显进展。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dangqnaj gij ginghci ginhyungz fungyiemj guek raeuz cungjdaej gaem ndaej, aeu goek byai caez ceih, mizyauq siucawz gij huxndumj fungyiemj.",
        "zh": "当前我国经济金融风险总体可控，要标本兼治，有效消除风险隐患。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yiemzhaenq dwkceih gij famhfap hozdung mbouj habfap comzcienz、ginhyungz yaeuhlox daengj.",
        "zh": "严厉打击非法集资、金融诈骗等违法活动。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyavaiq doenggvaq hawciengz nem fapceih bae guh caiqgienz cienj gujgienz caeuq giyez gyan'gyoeb dauqcungz cujhab.",
        "zh": "加快市场化法治化债转股和企业兼并重组。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyagiengz ginhyungz gihgou baihndaw gaemhanh fungyiemj.",
        "zh": "加强金融机构风险内控。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Giengzvaq cingjdaej suenqveh boiqhab gamguenj ginhyungz, laebndei gij banhfap gamguenj ngaenzhangz rumhngaeuz、ginhyungz vangjdoxlienz、aen gunghswh ginhyungz gaemguj lai daengj, caiq laebndei gamguenj ginhyungz、daezswng yauqnaengz gamguenj.",
        "zh": "强化金融监管统筹协调，健全对影子银行、互联网金融、金融控股公司等监管，进一步完善金融监管。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Fuengzre vaqgej gij fungyiemj deihfueng cwngfuj dawzcaiq.",
        "zh": "防范化解地方政府债务风险。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yiemzgimq gak loih hingzveiz famhfap famh gvidingh ciqcaiq、danbauj daengj.",
        "zh": "严禁各类违法违规举债、担保等行为。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Sengj gaep cwngfuj aeu doiq gij caiq diegguenj bonjfaenh rapdawz cungjdaej cwzyin, aen deihfueng cwngfuj sengj gaep doxroengz aeu gag rap gij cwzyin bonjfaenh, gaenxmaenx onjdangq cawqceq gij caiq yienhmiz.",
        "zh": "省级政府对本辖区债务负总责，省级以下地方政府各负其责，积极稳妥处置存量债务。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laebndei aen gihci gveihfan deihfueng cwngfuj yungzswh ciqcaiq.",
        "zh": "健全规范的地方政府举债融资机制。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bineix anbaiz deihfueng cienhangh caigen 1.35 fanh ik maenz, beij bi'gvaq demlai 5500 ik maenz, sien daemxcengj gij hanghmoeg cingqcaih hwnq de bingzonj hwnqguh gonq, hableix gya'gvangq aen gvaengh sawjyungh cienhangh caigen.",
        "zh": "今年安排地方专项债券1.35万亿元，比去年增加5500亿元，优先支持在建项目平稳建设，合理扩大专项债券使用范围。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ginghci guek raeuz cungjdaej lij ndei, cwngcwz fuengfap lai, vanzcienz ndaej souj maenh diuz daejsienq mbouj fatseng cungj fungyiemj baenzroix.",
        "zh": "我国经济基本面好，政策工具多，完全能够守住不发生系统性风险的底线。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gya rengz dawzcinj duetgungz.",
        "zh": "加大精准脱贫力度。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bineix caiq gemjnoix gij vunz gungzhoj lajmbanj 1000 fanh vunz doxhwnj, guhbaenz bang 280 fanh vunz senj dieg an'gya duetgungz.",
        "zh": "今年再减少农村贫困人口1000万以上，完成易地扶贫搬迁280万人。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Haeujlaeg doicaenh bang gij canjnieb、gyauyuz、ndangcangq、swnghdai caeuq vwnzva daengj duetgungz, bouj caez gij benjdinj giekdaej sezsih caeuq goenggungh fugsaeh, gyagiengz Baihdoeng Baihsae banggungz gapguh caeuq duigouj bangcoengh, ciet hoj mbouj lumz ciet sim mbouj lumz son raeh, hawj gyoengqde gag rox laemxsim bae baedrengz ra gwn.",
        "zh": "深入推进产业、教育、健康、生态扶贫，补齐基础设施和公共服务短板，激发脱贫内生动力。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
