        "zh": "对各类侵害消费者权益的行为，要依法惩处、决不姑息。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Hawj douzswh doiq gaijndei gij gapgyaq gunghawj miz ok cozyung ceiq youqgaenj.",
        "zh": "发挥投资对优化供给结构的关键性作用。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bineix yaek guhbaenz douzswh dietloh 7320 ik maenz、douzswh goengloh caeuq gwnzraemx daehyinh 1.8 fanh ik maenz baedauq, douzswh gij suijli cingqcaih hwnqguh de dabdaengz fanh ik maenz.",
        "zh": "今年要完成铁路投资7320亿元、公路水运投资1.8万亿元左右，水利在建投资规模达到1万亿元。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Hwnqguh giekdaej sezsih hungnaek yaek laebdaeb ngeng coh dieg Cungqgyang dieg Baihsae.",
        "zh": "重大基础设施建设继续向中西部地区倾斜。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bae guh aen gunghcwngz doiq gij gisuz hungnaek guh lwnz gaijcauh swnggaep moq.",
        "zh": "实施新一轮重大技术改造升级工程。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij douzswh ndaw cunghyangh yawhsuenq anbaiz 5376 ik maenz, beij bi'gvaq demgya 300 ik maenz.",
        "zh": "中央预算内投资安排5376亿元，比去年增加300亿元。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doeksaed gij cwngcwz guhfap gikcoi ndawbiengz douzswh, youq dietloh、minzhangz、youz heiq、densin daengj lingjyiz doi ok buek hanghmoeg ndaej yinx vunz ciengj guh ndeu, bietdingh aeu hawj gij swhbwnj ndawbiengz ndaej haeujbae、ndaej hwngfat.",
        "zh": "落实鼓励民间投资政策措施，在铁路、民航、油气、电信等领域推出一批有吸引力的项目，务必使民间资本进得来、能发展。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "（Bet）Doidoengh cauxbaenz aen gapgyaq geksik moq cienzmienh hailangh.",
        "zh": "（八）推动形成全面开放新格局。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Caiq gya'gvangq aen gvaengh caeuq caengzmbaek hailangh, hawj gij gapgyaq baijbouh caeuq dijci gihci hailangh engq ndei, aeu gij hailangh suijbingz sang bae doidoengh hwngfat caetliengh sang.",
        "zh": "进一步拓展开放范围和层次，完善开放结构布局和体制机制，以高水平开放推动高质量发展。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doicaenh gozci gapguh\"it rangh it loh\".",
        "zh": "推进“一带一路”国际合作。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Genhciz caezyaeng caezguh caezyungh, doeksaed gij cwngzgoj\"It Rangh It Loh\"Gozci Gapguh Gauhfungh Lundanz.",
        "zh": "坚持共商共建共享，落实“一带一路”国际合作高峰论坛成果。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doidoengh hwnqguh diuz roen hung gwnz gozci, gyalaeg youq henz roen daih doenggvan gapguh.",
        "zh": "推动国际大通道建设，深化沿线大通关合作。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gya'gvangq gozci swnghcanj naengzlig gapguh, yienghneix daiqdoengh Cungguek dajcauh caeuq Cungguek fugsaeh byaij okbae.",
        "zh": "扩大国际产能合作，带动中国制造和中国服务走出去。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Sawj gij gapgyaq doiq rog douzswh bienq ndei.",
        "zh": "优化对外投资结构。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gya rengz hailangh Baihsae、Diegndaw caeuq henz guek, daezsang gij suijbingz hwngfat giz ginghci gapguh henzguek hamjguek, gya'gvangq hoenggan moq hailangh gapguh.",
        "zh": "加大西部、内陆和沿边开放力度，拓展经济合作新空间。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
