    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyagiengz caeuq gij gveihcwz ginghci mouyiz gozci doenghengz de doxciep, cauhlaeb gij vanzging guh seng'eiq miz seiqgyaiq suijbingz.",
        "zh": "加强与国际通行经贸规则对接，建设国际一流营商环境。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cienzmienh hai gij hangznieb dajcauh itbuen de, hai doengh gij lingjyiz lumjbaenz densin、yihliuz、gyauyuz、ciengxlaux、ci yungh nwngzyenz moq daengj.",
        "zh": "全面放开一般制造业，扩大电信、医疗、教育、养老、新能源汽车等领域开放。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Miz gonqlaeng bae hai gij hawciengz lumjbaenz yinzhangzgaj cingsuenq daengj, mbouj caiq hanhhaed aen gvaengh ginghyingz cungj baujyiemj ginghgij gunghswh swhbwnj guekrog, cuengqsoeng roxnaeuz siubae hanhhaed gij gujfwn beijlaeh swhbwnj guekrog lumjbaenz yinzhangz、cwnggen、gihginh guenjleix、geizhuq、ginhyungz swhcanj guenjleix gunghswh daengj, doengjit aen biucinj swhbwnj ndawguek rogguek haeuj hawciengz ngaenzhangz.",
        "zh": "有序开放银行卡清算等市场，放开外资保险经纪公司经营范围限制，放宽或取消银行、证券、基金管理、期货、金融资产管理公司等外资股比限制，统一中外资银行市场准入标准。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Hawj bouxdouzswh rog gyaiq aeu leihyinh ndaw gyaiq caiq douzswh ndaej yienzgeiz nabgvaeh.",
        "zh": "实施境外投资者境内利润再投资递延纳税。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Hawj gij bouhloh banh aen giyez swhbwnj guekrog de bienq genjdanh bae, hongsaeh seng'eiq bwh'anq caeuq gunghsangh daenghgeiq\"youq giz ndeu banhleix\".",
        "zh": "简化外资企业设立程序，商务备案与工商登记“一口办理”。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cienzmienh ciuqguh doigbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Feihdauh mbouj loek, couhdwg nohvaiz cauj geq di lo.",
        "zh": "味道不错，就是牛肉炒老了点。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Byaekmbungj dwk gyu hix lai di lo.",
        "zh": "空心菜放盐也多了点。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz yaek banh gijmaz yezvu?",
        "zh": "您要办理什么业务？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou siengj hai an canghu he.",
        "zh": "我想开一个账户。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Banh cunzcez roxnaeuz yinzhangzgaj?",
        "zh": "办存折还是银行卡？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Banh cunzcez.",
        "zh": "办存折。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Banh yinzhangzgaj.",
        "zh": "办银行卡。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yinzhangzgaj engq bienhleih.",
        "zh": "银行卡更方便。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Banh hozgiz roxnaeuz dinggiz?",
        "zh": "办活期还是定期的？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Banh hozgiz.",
        "zh": "办活期。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeu banh gijmaz soujsuz ne?",
        "zh": "要办哪些手续呢？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz dienz mbaw biuj neix gonq. Dawz sinhfwncwng daeuj lwi?",
        "zh": "您先填写这张表。带身份证来没有？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dienz gijmaz ne?",
        "zh": "填什么呢？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dienz singqmingz、coh cwnggen caeuq haumaj cwnggen mwngz roengzbae.",
        "zh": "填上您的名字、证件名称和证件号码。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gek neix dienz gijmaz?",
        "zh": "这一格填什么？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gek neix dienz diegyouq lienzhaeh mwngz.",
        "zh": "这格填上您的联系地址。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gek haenx dienz gij coh cienz.",
        "zh": "那格填上货币名称。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou daeuj lingx cienz.",
        "zh": "我要取款。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij cienz mwngz cunz mboujcaengz daengz geiz.",
        "zh": "您的存款还没有到期。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou gaenj yungh cienz, dajsuenq daezgonq lingx okdaeuj.",
        "zh": "我急着用钱，打算提前取出。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Noix couh noix lo, gou hix mbouj miz banhfap.",
        "zh": "少就少了，我也没有办法。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz yaek lingx geijlai ngaenz?",
        "zh": "您要取多少钱？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Song fanh maenz.",
        "zh": "取2万元。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cingj naenx mizmaj.",
        "zh": "请输入您的密码。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz yungh yinzhangzgaj· youq gwnz swdung cijgvanjgih lingx hix ndaej.",
        "zh": "您用银行卡在自动取款机上取也行。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou siengj cunz cienz.",
        "zh": "我想存钱。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz yaek cunz geijlai cienz?",
        "zh": "您要存多少钱？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Fanh haj maenz, cunz buenq bi.",
        "zh": "15000元，存半年。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou siengj denvei bet bak maenz ngaenz.",
        "zh": "我想电汇800元。",
