        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yawj mwngz geiq bae guek lawz lo.",
        "zh": "看您寄到哪个国家了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dwzgvai conhdi geiq ndaw guek itbuen ndaw 48 aen cungdaeuz daengz.",
        "zh": "国内特快专递一般是48小时内到达。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bingzsaenq daj Namzningz daengz Baekging aeu geijlai nanz?",
        "zh": "从南宁到北京平信要多久才能够收到？",
