        "zh": "平信一般一个星期就能够到达。如果地方比较偏远，时间就长一些。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cingj cam youq gizlawz gvaqhauh?",
        "zh": "请问在哪里挂号？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Youq aen cueng baihgvaz ndaw ding.",
        "zh": "在大厅右边那个窗口。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz gvaq aen goh lawz?",
        "zh": "你挂哪个科目？",
