        "zh": "挂内科。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dwzsuh conhgyah hauh bet maenz, cujyin yihswh caeuq fucujyin yihswh hauh sam maenz haj, cujci yihswh hauh song maenz haj, cuyen yihswh hauh it maenz, mwngz gvaq cungj lawz?",
        "zh": "特殊专家号8元，主任副主任医师号3元5角，主治医师号2元5角，住院医师号1元，你要挂哪种？",
