        "zh": "没有。买一本吧！",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Neigoh youq gizlawz?",
        "zh": "内科在哪里？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Sam laeuz baihswix fungh daihseiq、fungh daihhaj、 fungh daihroek、fungh daihcaet cungj dwg neigoh, faenbied dwg conhgyah、cujyin fucujyin yihswh、cujci yihswh、cuyen yihswh.",
        "zh": "三楼左边的第四、第五、第六、第七间都是内科，分别是专家、主任副主任医师、主治医师、住院医师。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz baenzlawz la?",
        "zh": "你怎么啦？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dungxin, mbouj cwxcaih.",
        "zh": "肚子痛，不舒服。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gwn gijmaz yw gvaq la?",
        "zh": "吃过什么药没有？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mboujcaengz gwn gvaq.",
        "zh": "没有吃过。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Niemh lwed cangzgveih caeuq haex gonq.",
        "zh": "先检验血常规和大便。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou baenz gij_maz bingh ne?",
        "zh": "我得什么病？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj miz maz law, miz di veiyenz he, gwn di yw couh ndaej lo.",
        "zh": "没有什么大问题，有点胃炎，吃点药就可以了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Deng guh soujsuz lwi?",
        "zh": "要动手术吗？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou hai sam ngoenz yw hawj mwngz gonq, danghnaeuz mbouj ndei caiq daeuj yawj.",
        "zh": "先给你开3天的药，如果不好，再来看。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Youq gizlawz gyau ngaenz?",
        "zh": "在哪里交费？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gizgyaungaenz youq ngeih laeuz ndaw ding baihgvaz.",
        "zh": "交费处在二楼大厅右侧。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Youq gizlawz lingx yw?",
        "zh": "在哪里取药？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Youq it laeuz fuengzyw lingx yw.",
        "zh": "在一楼大厅药房取药。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Youq gizlawz banh soujsuz louzyih?",
        "zh": "在哪里办理住院手续？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Youq gizlawz banh soujsuz okyen?",
        "zh": "在哪里办理出院手续？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz bang gou ndaej lwi?",
        "zh": "你能帮个忙吗？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Miz gienh saeh he, cingj mwngz bang gou.",
        "zh": "有一件事，请你帮帮我。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bang mwngz guh gijmaz?",
        "zh": "需要帮什么忙？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cawx gijmaz doxgaiq?",
        "zh": "买什么东西呢？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cingj bang gou cawx bet gaen nohmou、roek gaen daeuhfouh caeuq haj gaen duhngaz, ndaej lwi?",
        "zh": "请你帮我买8斤猪肉、6斤豆腐和5斤豆芽，可以吗？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cingj daj denva daeuj, gou hawj lwgngez bae aeu.",
        "zh": "请来电话，我派小孩去拿。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz daeuj bang gou, gou ngoenzlaeng bae bang mwngz.",
        "zh": "你来帮我，过后我去帮你。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cingj dawz gij saw ndaw daeh okdaeuj.",
        "zh": "请把袋子里的书本拿出来。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cingj veq di, mienx deng bungq sieng.",
        "zh": "请让开，免得碰伤。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cingj gaej dangj gou, gou yawj mbouj raen hwzbanj.",
        "zh": "请不要挡住，我看不到黑板。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cingj gaej ngauz aen'eij, yingjyangj gou yawj saw.",
        "zh": "请不要摇晃椅子，影响我看书。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz miz maz yi'gen cingj gangj okdaeuj.",
        "zh": "有什么意见请你说出来。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cingj bang gou caz aen swz he.",
        "zh": "请帮我查一个单词。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yungh sat le, cingj cuengq dauq gwnz daiz.",
        "zh": "用完了，请放回我的桌子上。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cingj bang gou gip bonj saw haenx hwnjdaeuj.",
        "zh": "请帮我捡起那本书。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cingj gven daeng gven dou.",
        "zh": "请关灯关门。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ciq denva mwngz yungh yaep he, ndaej lwi?",
        "zh": "借你的电话用一下，可以吗？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doiq mbouj gvaq, gou youq gizneix cit ien ndaej lwi?",
        "zh": "对不起，我可以在这里抽烟吗？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cingj mwngz yienh gonj bit haenx hawj gou.",
        "zh": "请你递那支笔给我。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cingj byaij baih neix.",
        "zh": "请走这边。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cingj mwngz gangj vah sing daemq di.",
        "zh": "请你说话声音小一点。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cingj daihgya byaij vaiq di.",
        "zh": "请大家快点走。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz ciengeiz gaej lumz bw!",
        "zh": "你千万不要忘记啊！",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cingj mwngz gaisau gij cingzgvang gizhaenx baez he.",
        "zh": "请你介绍一下那里的清况。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mazfanz mwngz caiq gangj baez dem.",
        "zh": "麻烦你再说一下。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cingj mwngz caiq ndeindei naemj yaep he.",
        "zh": "请再好好考虑一下。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cingj mwngz gaej youq gizneix cit ien.",
        "zh": "请你不要在这里抽烟。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cingj mwngz cinjseiz daeuj bw!",
        "zh": "请你准时来啊！",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doig mbouj gvaq, gou daeuj nguh lo.",
        "zh": "对不起，我迟到了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Saedcaih doiq mbouj gvaq! Gou lumz gienh saeh neix lo.",
        "zh": "实在对不起！我把这件事给忘了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doiq mbouj gvaq, hawj sou caj nanz lo.",
        "zh": "对不起，让你们久等了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bungq deng mwngz lo, doiq mbouj gvaq.",
        "zh": "碰着你了，对不起。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cingj yienzliengh!",
        "zh": "请原谅！",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doiq mbouj gvaq, gou mbouj ndaej yienghneix guh.",
        "zh": "对不起，我不能这样做。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Caujfanz mwngz lo.",
        "zh": "打扰你了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gaej guhhek.",
        "zh": "别客气",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doiq mbouj gvaq, gou mbouj dwg daegdingq yienghneix guh.",
        "zh": "对不起，我不是故意这样做的。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doiq mbouj gvaq, gou mbouj rox gienh saeh neix.",
        "zh": "对不起，我不知道这件事。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doiq mbouj gvaq, gou gangj loeng lo.",
        "zh": "对不起，我说错了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doiq mbouj gvaq, gou daj loeng denva lo.",
        "zh": "对不起，我打错电话了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doiq mbouj gvaq, gou nyinh loek vunz lo.",
        "zh": "对不起，我认错人了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj youqgaenj law.",
        "zh": "不要紧的。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngoenzcog gou couh yaek dauq ranz lo, gou daeuj caeuq mwngz doxbiek.",
        "zh": "明天我就要回家了，我来跟您告别。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Seizgan gvaq ndaej caen vaiq ha!",
        "zh": "时间过得真快啊！",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj caeux lo, gou dauq ranz lo.",
        "zh": "不早了，我回家了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndei, mwngz baema ba.",
        "zh": "好，您回去吧。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou soengqsoengq mwngz.",
        "zh": "我送送您。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj yungh soengq lo, mwngz baema ba!",
        "zh": "不用送了，您回去吧。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz baenzneix nyaengq lij daeuj soengq gou, caen docih mwngz lo.",
        "zh": "您这么忙还来送我，真是谢谢您了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cuk sou swnh raemx swnh rumz!",
        "zh": "祝你们一路顺风！",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Maqmuengh sou ndaej caiq daeuj.",
        "zh": "希望你们能再来。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Maqmuengh raeuz miz gihvei caiq ndaej doxraen.",
        "zh": "希望咱们能有机会再见面。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Maqmuengh mwngz miz gihvei caiq daeuj Namzningz.",
        "zh": "希望您有机会再来南宁。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngoenzcog gou daeuj soengq mwngz.",
        "zh": "明天我来送您。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Docih mwngz daeuj soengq gou.",
        "zh": "谢谢您来送我。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Docih mwngz lai bi daeuj doiq gou baenzneix gvansim caeuq cmqgoq.",
        "zh": "谢谢您多年来对我这么关心和照顾。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doxgaiq mwngz cungj sousib ndei la?",
        "zh": "您的东西都收拾好了吗？",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndaej hoengq ciengz daeuj ranz dou guhcaemz.",
        "zh": "有空常来我们家玩。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Seizlawz ndaej hoengq couh daeuj guhcaemz.",
        "zh": "什么时候有空就来玩。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Vanhyingz sou caiq daeuj.",
        "zh": "欢迎你们再来。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndwen laeng caiq raen!",
        "zh": "下个月再见。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Baezlaeng raeuz caiq ndeindei gangjgoj.",
        "zh": "下次咱们再好好聊聊。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Nanz lai mbouj raen lo, mwngz ndang ndei lwi?",
        "zh": "很久不见了，你身体好吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Docih! Gou ndei raixcaix, mwngz ne?",
        "zh": "谢谢！我很好，你呢？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou hix ndei raixcaix, docih!",
        "zh": "我也很好，谢谢！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz yaek bae gizlawz?",
        "zh": "你要上哪儿去？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bae gai cawx di doxgaiq. Mwngz ne?",
        "zh": "上街买点东西。你呢？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou bae aen mbanj baihnaj ra boux lauxdoengz ndeu.",
        "zh": "我去前面的村子找一个结拜兄弟。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou byaij gonq lo. Ngoenzlawz raeuz miz seizgan caiq ndeindei gangjgoj.",
        "zh": "我先走了。哪天咱们有时间再好好聊。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndei. Mwngz ndei byaij!",
        "zh": "好。你好走！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz ndei!",
        "zh": "你好！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz ndei!",
        "zh": "你好！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mboengqneix hong nyaengq lwi?",
        "zh": "最近工作忙吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Nyaengq vei! Mboengqneix dwg mboengq \"ciengj sou ciengj ndaem\", baenzlawz mbouj nyaengq?",
        "zh": "忙啊！最近是“双抢”季节，怎么不忙？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ranz sou bineix ndaem reihnaz lai lwi?",
        "zh": "今年你家种的田地多吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj suenq lai. Reih haj moux, naz caet moux.",
        "zh": "不算多。旱地五亩，水田七亩。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Goenglaux, mwngz bae gizlawz ne?",
        "zh": "老大爷，您去哪儿呢？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou bae langh vaiz ne.",
        "zh": "我去放牛呢。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndang mwngz lij ndei ha?",
        "zh": "您身体还好吧？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Lij gvaq ndaej bae.",
        "zh": "还过得去。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz ndei! Gou dwg Veiz Gyangz, mwngz heuh gou Daeggyangz couh ndaej lo.",
        "zh": "你好！我是韦强，你叫我阿强好了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz ndei! Gou dwg Cinz Bingz.",
        "zh": "你好！我是陈萍。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daeggyangz, mwngz dwg vunz gizlawz?",
        "zh": "阿强，你是哪里人？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou dwg vunz Liujcouh. Mwngz ne?",
        "zh": "我是柳州人。你呢？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou dwg vunz Yizcouh. Yizcouh liz Liujcouh mbouj gyae geijlai, gou ciengzseiz bae Liujcouh youz.",
        "zh": "我是宜州人。宜州离柳州不太远，我经常去柳州游玩。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou daeuj gaisau mbat he, neix dwg baengzyoux gou Daeggvei.",
        "zh": "我来介绍一下，这是我的朋友阿贵。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz ndei! Gou dingqgangj coh mwngz gvaq. Yangh cwngfuj naeuz rnwngz bae Guengjdoeng dajgoeng, hag ndaej gisuz le couh dauqma ranz dajciengx dajndaem, mizcienz lo.",
        "zh": "你好！我听说过你的名字。乡政府说你去广东打工，学到技术就回家乡搞种养，致富了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyawz miz! Gyawz miz! Gou couhdwg siengj daiq gyoengqbeixnuengx ndaw mbanj guh di saehcingz.",
        "zh": "哪里！哪里！我只是想带领乡亲们做点事情。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndei ha! Raeuz bouxcoz clan okbae gai goeng rengz mbouj dwg banhfap, yaek hag di gisuz dauqma gaijbienq mienhmauh ndaw mbanj cij ndaej.",
        "zh": "好啊！咱们年轻人光出去卖力气不是办法，得学点技术回来改变家乡的面貌才行。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou dingqnyi naeuz Mbanjveiz miz boux hauxseng he, ndaem byaek gig miz gisuz, ngoenz lawz mwngz gaisau gou roxnaj de ndaej lwi?",
        "zh": "我听说韦村有个年轻人，种蔬菜的技术很好，哪天你介绍我认识认识，好吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "O, mwngz dwg gangj Daeggangh ha, gou sug de. Daeg neix mbouj loek. Vunz cungj okbae dajgoeng, de cix gag ok cienz bae Namzningz hag gisuz ndaem byaek, hag baenz le dauqma bau haj cib moux reih, cienmonz ndaem gij byaek fanj gicez.",
        "zh": "哦，你说的是阿刚啊，我熟悉他。这小伙子不错。人家都出去打工，他却自费到南宁学蔬菜种植技术，学成回来后承包了50亩地，专门种反季节蔬菜。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": ". Seizneix ndaem byaek fanj gicez canh cienz, gou hix siengj hag monz gisuz neix.",
        "zh": "现在种反季节蔬菜赚钱，我也想学这门技术。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndei ha! Ngoenzcog gou couh daiq mwngz bae raen de.",
        "zh": "好啊！明天我就带你去见他。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Docih mwngz lo!",
        "zh": "谢谢你了！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dwg bouxlawz ha?",
        "zh": "是谁呀？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bohlungz, mwngz ndei! Gou dwg Daegliengz, dwg baengzyoux Daegveih.",
        "zh": "伯父，您好！我是阿良，是阿辉的朋友。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daegveih mbouj youq ranz. De bae yawj denyingj mbouj caengz ma.",
        "zh": "阿辉不在家。他去看电影没回来。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "O! Yienghneix gou ngoenzcog caiq daeuj.",
        "zh": "哦！那我明天再来。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndei, ndei byaij nw!",
        "zh": "好，好走啊！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou laihnaeuz dwg bouxlawz, yienzlaiz dwg mwngz!",
        "zh": "我以为是谁，原来是你！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raeuz haujlai nanz mbouj doxraen lo.",
        "zh": "咱们很久不见了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dwg vei, vaiq haeuj ranz daeuj.",
        "zh": "是啊，快进屋。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz cingq guh gijmaz ne?",
        "zh": "你在做什么呢？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou cingq yawj bauqceij.",
        "zh": "我正在看报。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yawj gijmaz bauqceij?",
        "zh": "看什么报？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "《Gvangjsih Yizbau》.",
        "zh": "《广西日报》。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cawz faenh bauqceij neix, mwngz lij dingh gijmaz bauqceij wnq lwi?",
        "zh": "除了这份报纸，你还订其他什么报吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dingh vei! Lij dingq miz《Gvangjsih Gohgi Bau》、《Nungzminz Yizbau》、《Cunghgoz Yangjciz Bau》.Mwngz bingzseiz yawj bauqceij lwi?",
        "zh": "订啊！还订有《广西科技报》、《农民日报》、《中国养殖报》。你平常看报吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj yawj geijlai. Gou gyaez dingq gvangjbo roxnaeuz yawj densi.",
        "zh": "不怎么看。我喜欢听广播或者看电视。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dahva, dingqnaeuz ndaw yangh yaek banh\"gohyoz cung'yangj beizyinbanh\"?",
        "zh": "阿花，听说乡里要开办“科学种养培训班”?",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dwg vei! Gou hix dingqnaeuz lo.",
        "zh": "是啊！我也听说了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Seizneix guh dajndaem dajciengx, yaek gangj gohyoz cij ndaej. Raeuz caez bae bauqmingz camgya yozsiz, ndei lwi?",
        "zh": "现在搞种养，要讲科学才行。咱们一起去报名参加学习，好吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndei ha! Raeuz ngoenzcog couh bae bauqmingz.",
        "zh": "好啊！咱们明天就去报名。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daeghungz, haemh cobet Daegmingz gezvwnh cingj laeuj, mwngz bae lwi?",
        "zh": "阿宏，初八晚上阿明结婚请酒，你去吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bae vei! Daengz seiz raeuz caez guhdoih bae ba.",
        "zh": "去啊！到时候咱们结伴一起去吧。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndei ha! Couhdwg mbouj rox soengq gijmaz laex ndei.",
        "zh": "好啊！就是不知道送什么礼物好。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj yungh soengq laex, daj fungbau couh ndaej lo.",
        "zh": "不用送礼物，打红包就行了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Fung geijlai ndei ne?",
        "zh": "封多少好呢？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Itbuen it bak maenz couh ndaej lo, baengzyoux ndei couh lai fung di hix ndaej.",
        "zh": "一般一百元就可以了，好朋友就多封一点也行。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laujvangz, haemhneix mwngz ndaej hoengq lwi?",
        "zh": "老黄，今天晚上你有空吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndaej hoengq. Miz maz saeh?",
        "zh": "有空。有什么事？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laujcangh yaek diuh bae yienhsingz gunghcoz lo, raeuz geij boux baengzyoux cingj de gwn cenj laeuj hohhoh.",
        "zh": "老张准备调到县城工作了，咱们几个朋友请他喝杯酒庆祝庆祝。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndei ha! Youq gizlawz cingj?",
        "zh": "好响！在哪里请？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Couh youq ranz gou ndaej lo. Gou heuh yah gou loengh geij yiengh byaek couh ndaej lo.",
        "zh": "就在我家好了。我让我妻子弄几个菜就行了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Geij diemj cung ne?",
        "zh": "几点钟呢？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Roek diemj buenq ba!",
        "zh": "六点半吧！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij neix dwg gijmaz?",
        "zh": "这些是什么？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij neix dwg faengx.",
        "zh": "这些是粽子。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij haenx ne?",
        "zh": "那些呢？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij haenx dwg ceiz.",
        "zh": "那些是糍粑。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Duz neix dwg duz maz?",
        "zh": "这是什么动物？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Duz neix dwg duzgoep.",
        "zh": "这是田鸡。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Duz haenx hix dwg duzgoep lwi?",
        "zh": "那只也是田鸡吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj dwg, dwg duzgvej.",
        "zh": "不是，是小青蛙。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyaq danci haenx dwg duh bouxlawz?",
        "zh": "那辆自行车是谁的？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dwg duh gou.",
        "zh": "是我的。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyaq danci mwngz dwg baiz gijmaz?",
        "zh": "你的自行车是什么牌子的？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dwg funghvuengz baiz.",
        "zh": "是凤凰牌的。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Naj mbanj sou miz gijmaz?",
        "zh": "你们村前面有什么？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Naj mbanj dou miz diuz dah he.",
        "zh": "我们村前面有一条河。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laeng mbanj sou ne?",
        "zh": "你们村后面呢？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Miz goengq bya hung he.",
        "zh": "有一座大山。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Henz mbanj sou ndaem miz haujlai faex, caen gyaeundei.",
        "zh": "你们村边种有很多树，真漂亮。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ciq fagcanj mwngz hawj gou yungh yaep he ndaej lwi?",
        "zh": "借你的铲子用一下可以吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doiq mbouj gvaq, gou lij yungh ne!",
        "zh": "对不起，我还要用呢！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Geu huh neix byoengq lo, daenj mbouj ndaej lo.",
        "zh": "这件衣服破了，不能穿了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Fongfong lij daenj ndaej.",
        "zh": "补一补还可以穿。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Seizneix dwg geij diemj la?",
        "zh": "现在是几点了？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Caet diemj haj cib faen lo.",
        "zh": "七点五十分了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Caiq gvaq cib faen cung ci couh hai lo, raeuz byaij vaiq di!",
        "zh": "再过十分钟车就开了，咱们快走吧！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz caj gou yaep he.",
        "zh": "你等我一会儿。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj miz seizgan lo, byaij vaiq di!",
        "zh": "没有时间了，快点儿走！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz moix haet geij diemj cung hwnq?",
        "zh": "您每天几点钟起床？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Roek diemj hwnq.",
        "zh": "六点钟起床。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou ngoenznaengz aeu ninz bet aen cungdaeuz baedauq.",
        "zh": "我每天要睡八个小时左右。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou nienzgeij geq lo, siengj lai ninz di hix ninz mbouj ndaek ha!",
        "zh": "我上年纪了，想多睡也睡不着啊！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz hag Vahcuengh geijlai nanz la?",
        "zh": "你学壮语多久了？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Song sam ndwen lo. Seizneix gou beij gaxgonq rox gangj haujlai Vahcuengh lo.",
        "zh": "两三个月了。现在我比以前能说更多壮语了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gaxgonq mwngz daeuj gvaq gizneix lwi?",
        "zh": "以前你来过这里吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Caengz daeuj gvaq.",
        "zh": "没有来过。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gaxgonq mbanj dou mbouj doeng dienh mbouj doeng ci, seizneix doeng dienh hix doeng ci lo.",
        "zh": "我们村从前不通电不通车，现在通电也通车了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yienghneix couh ndei lai lo!",
        "zh": "这样就太好了！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngoenzneix dwg singhgiz geij la?",
        "zh": "今天是星期几了？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngoenzneix dwg singhgiz sam.",
        "zh": "今天是星期三。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "O, ngoenzcog couh dwg ngoenzhaw lo, gou siengj bae haw cawx di doxgaiq, mwngz bae mbouj bae?",
        "zh": "哦，明天就是圩日，我想去集市上买点东西，你去不去？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou hix siengj bae cawx di doxgaiq. Ngoenzcog raeuz guhdoih bae ba!",
        "zh": "我也想去买点东西。明天咱们一起去吧！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dingqnaeuz ndwen neix ranz sou youh gai rog moulwg ndeu. Dwg lwi?",
        "zh": "听说这个月你们家又卖了一窝猪恩。是吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dwg vei.",
        "zh": "是啊。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Rog moulwg neix gungh miz geijlai duz?",
        "zh": "这窝猪患一共有多少头？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cib duz.",
        "zh": "10头。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndwen gonq rog haenx miz geijlai duz?",
        "zh": "上个月那一窝有多少头？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Rog haenx lij lai di, cib ngeih duz.",
        "zh": "那一窝多一点，12头。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ranz sou gungh ciengx miz geijlai duz moumeh?",
        "zh": "你们家一共养有多少头母猪？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bi'gvaq ciengx roek duz, bineix youh ciengx bet duz.",
        "zh": "去年养有6头，今年又养了8头。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj loek ha! Yienghneix ranz sou ca mbouj lai ndwenndwen cungj miz moulwg gai.",
        "zh": "不错啊！这样你们家差不多每个月都有猪崽卖。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Geij bi neix ciengx moumeh gai moulwg lij haemq canh cienz, mboujgvaq cingzbonj hix mbouj daemq.",
        "zh": "这几年养母猪卖猪息还比较赚钱，不过成本也不低。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laujveiz, aen ranz moq sou hwnj ndei mboujcaengz?",
        "zh": "老韦，你们家的新房建好没有？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ca mbouj lai lo.",
        "zh": "差不多了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aen ranz sou hwnj geij caengz?",
        "zh": "你们家的房子建几层？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Sam caengz.",
        "zh": "三层。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngoenz lawz haeuj ranz moq?",
        "zh": "哪一天入新房？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndwen laeng cobet.",
        "zh": "下个月初八。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndei ha! Daengz ngoenz haenx gou itdingh bae goenghoh sou.",
        "zh": "好啊！到那天我一定去恭贺你们。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mehbaj, Mbanjnazmax baenzlawz bae?",
        "zh": "伯母，那马村怎么走？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Riengz diuz roen henz dah haenx byaij roengzbae, ngeih cib lai faen cung couh yawjraen lo.",
        "zh": "沿着河边那条路走下去，二十来分钟就看见了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Miz ruz bae lwi?",
        "zh": "有船去吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Miz ha, hoeng ngoenzneix ruz cungj okbae lo.",
        "zh": "有啊，不过今天船都出去了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Docih mwngz.",
        "zh": "谢谢您。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doiq mbouj gvaq, gou siengj ra ranz cunhcangj, ranz de youq gizlawz ne?",
        "zh": "对不起，我想找村长家，他家在哪儿呢？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "O, ranz cunhcangj ha, couh youq baihhaenx, henz ranz miz go faexrungz he.",
        "zh": "哦，村长家啊，就在那边，房子旁边有一棵大叶树。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj rox cunhcangj youq mbouj youq ranz?",
        "zh": "不知道村长在不在家？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Haxbaenh gou lij raen de ndwn youq bakdou daj soujgih, seizneix wngdang youq ranz.",
        "zh": "刚才我还看见他站在门口打手机，现在应该在家。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Docih mwngz lo.",
        "zh": "谢谢您了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj yungh.",
        "zh": "不用谢。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbanj sou liz mbanj haenx gyae lwi?",
        "zh": "你们村离那个村远吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyae dauq mbouj suenq gyae, hoeng miz diuz dah he gek dwk, baedauq mbouj fuengbienh geijlai.",
        "zh": "远倒是不远，不过有一条河隔着，来往不怎么方便。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Youq laj sok miz ruz baedauq lwi?",
        "zh": "在码头有船来往吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Miz, lij miz saz dem. Dingqnaeuz cwngfuj yaek youq gwnz dah naj mbanj dou guh diuz giuz ndeu.",
        "zh": "有，还有竹筏子。听说政府要在我们村前的河上架一座桥。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yienghneix couh ndei lai lo.",
        "zh": "这样就太好了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dwg veil Miz giuz baedauq couh fuengbienh lai lo.",
        "zh": "是啊！有桥来往就方便多了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daj mbanj sou daengz yienhsingz miz geij gyae?",
        "zh": "从你们村到县城有多远？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Miz seiq cib lai leix.",
        "zh": "有40多里。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Seizneix mbanj sou doeng ci caengz?",
        "zh": "你们村现在通车没有？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doeng lo. Moix ngoenz miz sam ban banci.",
        "zh": "通了。每天有3趟班车。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Naengh banci daj mbanj sou bae daengz yienhsingz aeu geijlai nanz?",
        "zh": "坐班车从你们村到县城要多久？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gaxgonq roen mbouj ndei, buenq ngoenz lij caengz daengz. Seizneix roen coih ndei lo, mbouj yungh aen cungdaeuz couh daengz lo.",
        "zh": "以前路不好走，走半天还没到。现在路修好了，不用一个小时就到了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yangh sou miz geijlai aen cunhveijvei?",
        "zh": "你们乡有多少个村委会？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Miz cib ngeih aen cunhveijvei.",
        "zh": "有12个村委会。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Miz geijlai aen mbanj?",
        "zh": "有多少个自然村？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Miz bet cib lai aen mbanj.",
        "zh": "有80多个自然村。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daengx yangh miz geijlai vunz?",
        "zh": "全乡有多少人口？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Miz sam fanh lai vunz.",
        "zh": "有3万多人。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mboengqneix fwn caen lai.",
        "zh": "这段时间雨真多。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dwg vei! Ca mbouj lai ngoenzngoenz cungj roengz song sam raq.",
        "zh": "是啊！差不多每天都下两三场。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngoenzfwn sou lij bae ndaem naz ha?",
        "zh": "下雨天你们还去插秧啊？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bae vei! Caiq gvaq geij ngoenz couh haeujcou lo, lij miz haj moux lai naz caengz ndaem, yaek ganj seizgan cij ndaej.",
        "zh": "去啊！再过几天就入秋了，还有五亩多田没插，得赶时间才行。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doiq mbouj gvaq, gou siengj ra Vangz lauxsae.",
        "zh": "对不起，我想找黄老师。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De ngamq okbae.",
        "zh": "他刚出去。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De.seizlawz dauqma?",
        "zh": "他什么时候回来？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou mbouj rox.",
        "zh": "我不知道。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yienghneix gou gvaq yaephe caiq daeuj.",
        "zh": "那我过一会儿再来。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz ra bouxlawz?",
        "zh": "你找谁？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou ra cunhveijvei cujyin.",
        "zh": "我找村委会主任。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De cingq haihoih, mwngz naengh youq gizneix caj yaep he.",
        "zh": "他正在开会，你坐在这里等一会儿。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndei. Doicih mwngz lo.",
        "zh": "好的。谢谢你了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou ra Veiz Gyangz dungzci.",
        "zh": "我找韦强同志。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou couh dwg.",
        "zh": "我就是。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou dwg yangh cwngfuj bangunghsiz Siujlij. Yanghcangj heuh gou dunghcih mwngz, ngoenzcog de yaek daiq yen lingjdauj bae ranz mwngz, yawj mwngz baenzlawz gohyoz dajndaem dajciengx.",
        "zh": "我是乡政府办公室的小李。乡长叫我通知您，明天他要带县领导到您家，看您怎样搞科学种养。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndei ha. Ngoenzcog gou youq ranz caj gyoengqde.",
        "zh": "好啊。明天我在家等他们。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz siengj cawx gijmaz?",
        "zh": "你想买什么？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Siengj cam di saeh ndeu.",
        "zh": "想间一些事。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gijmaz saeh?",
        "zh": "什么事？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Rangh neix gangj vah maz lai?",
        "zh": "这一带主要说什么话？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Neix dwg bien'gvan. Vahcuengh、Begvah、 Bujdunghva、Vahyeznanz、Vahdaigoz, cungj miz vunz gangj.",
        "zh": "这是边关。壮话、白话、普通话、越南语、泰语，都有人说。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz swhgeij rox geijlai cungj?",
        "zh": "你自己会多少种？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou cungj rox geij cungj vah neix.",
        "zh": "这几种语言我都会。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz baenzlawz hag?",
        "zh": "你怎么学的？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Youq neix ngoenzngoenz dingq, seizseiz gangj, nanz le couh sug lo.",
        "zh": "在这里天天听，时时讲，久了就熟悉啦。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cungj vah lawz lai hoj hag?",
        "zh": "哪种语言比较难学？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Haengj aj bak cungj lawz cungj mbouj hoj.",
        "zh": "肯开口哪样都不难。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daegsam ha! Cae reih dajsuenq ndaem gijmaz?",
        "zh": "老三呀！犁地打算种什么？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "O! Lauxlungz. Gou siengj doek di duhheu.",
        "zh": "哦！老伯。我想种些绿豆。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doek duhheu daihgaiq ceiz bae di lo.",
        "zh": "种绿豆大概晚了一些啦。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj heiq, gij duhheu neix haeuj cin le banlawz ndaem cungj ndaej.",
        "zh": "不用担忧，这些绿豆入春了什么时候种都行。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij reih mwngz dwg reih ngamq hai, ndaem lwgraz lai ndei.",
        "zh": "你的地是刚开垦的，种芝麻较好。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Vih maz ne?",
        "zh": "为什么呢？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndaem lwgraz ndaej ong dieg.",
        "zh": "种芝麻能使土地肥沃。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou bae gizlawz ra ceh lwgraz?",
        "zh": "我去哪里找芝麻种子？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gwnz haw giz gai cehbyaek de hix gai ceh lwgraz.",
        "zh": "街上卖菜种的地方也卖芝麻种。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeu byaekmou ha, mehbaj?",
        "zh": "采摘猪菜啊，伯母？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dwg vei! Mwngz bae gizlawz ne?",
        "zh": "是啊！你去哪里呢？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou bae gwnz haw cawx daeh vafeiz ndeu.",
        "zh": "我去集市买一袋化肥。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dingqnaeuz ranz mwngz geij bi neix ndaem haeux、 ndaem byaek caeuq gomak bienq fouq lo.",
        "zh": "听说你家这儿年种水稻、种蔬菜和果树致富了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dwg ha. Ranz gou mboujdan ndaem haeux, lij youq gwnz reih ndaem gij ginghci cozvuz, baengh gohyoz bienq fouq.",
        "zh": "是啊。我家不但种水稻，还在旱地里种经济作物，靠科学致富。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Caen ndei ha! Bi'moq gou hix aeu youq ndawreih ndaem byaek、ndaem gomak, byaij diuzloh gohyoz bienq fouq.",
        "zh": "真好啊！明年我也要在旱地里种蔬菜、果树，走科学致富之路。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Goengheij! Goengheij! Daeuj hawj mwngz bouxgeq baiqnienz!",
        "zh": "恭喜！恭喜！来给您老人家拜年！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Caez heij! Caez heij! Daihgya ndei!",
        "zh": "同喜！同喜！大家好！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Goengheij mwngz bouxgeq ndang ndei ndang cangq gyaeu bak bi!",
        "zh": "恭喜您老人家身体健康长寿百岁！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyo mwngz vah ndei, bineix daih gaet daih leih!",
        "zh": "托你吉言，今年大吉大利！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Hawj mwngz bouxgeq aen fungbau neix gyaemz rwz nuk.",
        "zh": "给您老人家这个红包压岁防耳聋。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeyo! Mwngz hekheiq lai lo!",
        "zh": "哎哟！你太客气啦！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Haethaemh mbouj hoengq daeuj yaWJ mwngz bouxgeq, mwngz lai ok dou byaij di.",
        "zh": "平时没空来探望您老人家，您多出门走动走动。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Sengsuh sengsuh!",
        "zh": "感谢感谢！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dingqnaeuz sou Bouxcuengh it bi hix miz haujlai ngoenzciet.",
        "zh": "听说你们壮族人一年也有很多节日。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dwg vei! Ca mbouj lai ndwenndwen cungj miz ngoenzciet.",
        "zh": "是啊！差不多每个月都有节日。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbangj ngoenzciet Bouxcuengh caeuq ngoenzciet Bouxgun doxdoengz.",
        "zh": "有的壮族节日跟汉族节日一样。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dwg yienghneix. Vwnzva Bouxgun doiq Bouxcuengh yingjyangj gig laeg, mbangj ngoenzciet Bouxgun gvaq, Bouxcuengh hix gvaq, lumjbaenz ndwencieng、cingmingz、 nguxnyied co'ngux、betnyied cibhaj.",
        "zh": "是这样的。汉族文化对壮族影响很深，有的节日，汉族过，壮族也过，如春节、清明节、端午节、中秋节。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Va! Uj baenzlai byaek, caujfanz sou lo!",
        "zh": "哇！弄这么多菜，麻烦你们了！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj miz maz le. Cungj dwg gijgwn bingzseiz.",
        "zh": "没啥的。都是平常食物。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Baenz lo. Ngoenzngoenz yienghneix miz bya noh, ndwenngoenz ndei gvaq lo.",
        "zh": "行啦。天天这样有鱼、肉，日子好过啦。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gaiq noh gyoq mij, mbouj dij maz cienz. Baengzyoux daeuj gangjgoj cix ndei.",
        "zh": "肉片如炭头，不值什么钱。主要是朋友来聊天的。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj gangj yungh cienz, clan cawj byaek doq aeu mwngz baeg.",
        "zh": "不说用钱，单是煮菜你都会累。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Uj geij aen byaek mbouj nanz.",
        "zh": "弄几个菜不难。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou couh mbouj lumj mwngz miz cungj bonjsaeh neix.",
        "zh": "我就不如你有这种本事。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gaej guhhek. Lai gwn di. Cawj mbouj gwn cawj ged, hek mbouj gwn hek bamz!",
        "zh": "别客气。多吃一些。主不吃主吝啬，客不吃客笨蛋。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou nyengh mbouj guh vunzbamz!",
        "zh": "我才不当笨蛋呢！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bouxcuengh gizneix gwn miz maz daegdiemj lwi?",
        "zh": "这里的壮族饮食有什么特点吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Miz ha. Aenvih gizneix gyawj Gveicouh, Bouxcuengh gizneix gig gyaez gwn lwgmanh, guh gijmaz byaek cungj cuengq lwgmanh.",
        "zh": "有啊。因为这里比较近贵州，这里的壮族很喜欢吃辣椒，做什么菜都放辣椒。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yienghneix gou couh mbouj gamj gwn lo.",
        "zh": "那我就不敢吃了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj youqgaenj, mwngz mbouj gwn lwgmanh, dou lingh cauj di byaek wnq hawj mwngz.",
        "zh": "不要紧，你不吃辣椒，我们另外给你炒点别的菜。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Va! Mwngz naeuz byaek neix mbouj coq lwgmanh, vihlawz lij baenzneix manh ha?",
        "zh": "哇！你说这菜没放辣椒，为什么还这么辣啊？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "O, daihgaiq dwg rek cauj lwgmanh nanz lo, baenzlawz riengx cungj lij miz di manh.",
        "zh": "哦，大概是锅炒辣椒久了，怎么刷洗都还有点辣。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Lauxsae, gou daiq lwgnyez daeuj bauqmingz doeg saw.",
        "zh": "老师，我带小孩来报名读书。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Lwgnyez ndaej geijlai hung la?",
        "zh": "小孩多大了？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Song ndwen dem couh ndaej caet hop.",
        "zh": "再过两个月就满七岁。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz vaiq lwnh lauxsae mwngz heuh gijmaz coh.",
        "zh": "你快告诉老师你叫什么名字。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Lauxsae ndei! Gou dwg Vangz Fangh. Siengj daeuj yozyau doeg saw.",
        "zh": "老师好！我叫王芳。想来学校读书。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ranz mwngz youq gizlawz?",
        "zh": "你家住在哪里？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ranz gou youq Mbanjmoq rog haw.",
        "zh": "我家在镇外的新村。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cogneix daeuj doeg saw, bouxlawz soengq mwngz daeuj yozyau?",
        "zh": "以后来读书，谁送你来学校？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj aeu vunz soengq. Dou miz doih caez daeuj.",
        "zh": "不要人送。我们有伙伴一齐来。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "O! Caen gvai! Hai hag mwngz couh daeuj doeg saw.",
        "zh": "哦！真乖！开学你就来读书。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ranz mwngz youq gizlawz?",
        "zh": "你家在哪里？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ranz gou youq Bwzswz.",
        "zh": "我家在百色。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Liz gizneix gyae lwi?",
        "zh": "离这里远吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj suenq gyae, miz haj cib lai leix loh.",
        "zh": "不算远，有五十多里路。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz miz geij beixnuengx?",
        "zh": "你有几个兄弟姐妹？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Miz daeggo ndeu, dahnuengx ndeu.",
        "zh": "有一个哥哥，一个妹妹。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyoengqde cungj youq ranz guh reihnaz ha?",
        "zh": "他们都在家务农吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj, daeggo youq dayoz doeg saw, dahnuengx lij doeg cuhcungh",
        "zh": "不，哥哥在大学读书，妹妹还在读初中。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Haeux moq! Haeux moq! Haeuxsuen moq!",
        "zh": "新米！新米！新梗米！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij haeux mwngz dwg buenq rox gag ndaem?",
        "zh": "你的米是贩的还是自己种的？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dwg haeux gag ndaem.",
        "zh": "是自己种的。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz vunz gizlawz?",
        "zh": "你哪里人？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Vunz gizlawz caeuq haeux miz maz gvanhaeh?",
        "zh": "什么地方的人跟米有什么关系？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Miz lo. Dieg ndei haeux cij baenz gwn!",
        "zh": "有啊。好土地米才好吃！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou vunz Nazyouz. Liz gizneix mbouj gyae.",
        "zh": "我是那油人。离这里不远。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Nazyouz aen mbanj neix gou daengz gvaq, haeuxsuen haeuxcid cungj ndei.",
        "zh": "那油这个村我到过，梗米糯米都好。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Langh saenq ndaej gvaq couh lai cawx di.",
        "zh": "要是信得过就多买一些。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndei gangj, ndei gangj.",
        "zh": "好说好说。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dingq mwngz gangj vah lumj dwg vunz Duh'anh.",
        "zh": "听你的口音好像是都安人。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj dwg, gou vunzajsanh.",
        "zh": "不是，我是马山人。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Vunz Majsanh? Vihlawz mwngz gangj vah dwg sing Duh'anh?",
        "zh": "马山人？为什么你说话是都安口音？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ranz dou dwg daj Duh'anh senj daeuj, daengz Majsanh ngamq sam daih. Moix bi cingmingz ranz dou lij dauq Duh'anh bae sauqmoh ne.",
        "zh": "我们家是从都安迁来的，到马山才三代。每年清明节我们家还回都安扫墓呢。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "O, gvaiq mbouj ndaej.",
        "zh": "哦，怪不得。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dingqnaeuz mwngz mbouj dwg Bouxcuengh, vihlawz ranz sou daeuj daengz dieg Cuengh ne?",
        "zh": "听说你不是壮族人，为什么你们家来到壮族地区呢？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ranz dou daeuj daengz dieg neix gaenq miz caet bet daih lo. Dieg coj dou youq Fuzgen. Gaxgonq goengcoj dou daeuj dieg neix guh seng'eiq, raen dieg neix seng'eiq ndei guh, couh youq roengzdaeuj lo.",
        "zh": "我们家来到这里已经有七八代了。我们的祖籍在福建。从前我们的祖先到这里做生意，见这里生意好做，就住下来了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yienzlaiz dwg yienghneix ha!",
        "zh": "原来是这样啊！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Neix youq dieg Cuengh miz haujlai Bouxgun, gyoengqde haujlai vunz cungj rox gangj Vahcuengh, caeuq Bouxcuengh doxndei lumj beixnuengx nei.",
        "zh": "现在在壮族地区有很多汉族人，他们许多人都会说壮语，跟壮族亲如兄弟。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Miz vunj lwgnyez lwi?",
        "zh": "有小孩的裙子吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Lai lo. Lwg mwngz ndaej geijlai bi ne?",
        "zh": "多啦。你小孩几岁了呢？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Seiq bi lo.",
        "zh": "四岁了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De gyaez gijmaz saek?",
        "zh": "她喜欢什么颜色？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De gyaez vunj heu vunj hoengz, miz va ceiq ndei.",
        "zh": "她喜欢青裙和红裙，有花最好。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou ngamq aeu buek huq ndeu dauq, caengz hai bau.",
        "zh": "我刚进了一批货，尚未开包。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Hai hawj gou yawj, habhoz gou couh cawx.",
        "zh": "开给我看，合适我就买。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dungzci, gou siengj cawx gouh haiznaeng saek ndaem ndeu.",
        "zh": "同志，我想买一双黑色皮鞋。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz daenj geijlai max?",
        "zh": "你穿多少码的？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Sam cib bet max.",
        "zh": "38码。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Neix miz gouh ndeu, mwngz sawq daenjdaenj yawj.",
        "zh": "这里有一双，你试穿穿看。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Miz di ndaet, mwngz vuenh sam cib gouj max hawj gou ndaej lwi?",
        "zh": "有点紧，你换一双39码的给我好吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndaej, mwngz caj yaep he.",
        "zh": "行，你稍等一下。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gouh neix hab lo, gou couh cawx gouh neix.",
        "zh": "这双合适了，我就买这双。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz dawz mbaw fei neix bae gizsoungaenz gyau cienz ba.",
        "zh": "你拿这张单据到收款处交钱吧。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Docih mwngz lo.",
        "zh": "谢谢你了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj yungh.",
        "zh": "不用谢。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbwn laepcupcup, mwngz yaek bae gizlawz?",
        "zh": "天黑沉沉，你要去哪里？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou lau doek fwn hung, yaek bae yozyau ciep lwg.",
        "zh": "我怕下大雨，要去学校接儿子。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Duzbit angq raemx, lwgsai angq fwn. Baenzlawz yungh mwngz bae ciep?",
        "zh": "鸭子喜水，男孩喜雨。哪里用你去接？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Fwn rwed de baenz gaeq doek cingj bae mwngz couh raen lo!",
        "zh": "雨把他淋成落汤鸡你就见鬼椤！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbwn dumz mbwn dak, mwngz fanz gijmaz.",
        "zh": "天淋湿由天来晒，你烦忧什么。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou mbouj hoengq caeuq mwngz euq lai. Mwngz vaiq yien vaiz bae ranz!",
        "zh": "我没空跟你顶嘴。你快牵牛回家！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Suenq lo, gou bae ciep lwg cixbah.",
        "zh": "算了，我去接小孩罢了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Neix cij lumj di bohranz!",
        "zh": "这才像点男当家！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou banlawz youh mbouj lumj bohranz ne!",
        "zh": "我什么时候又不像男当家呢！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Baebawq dauqdawq! Fwn naeuz daengz couh daengz!",
        "zh": "快去快回！雨说到就到！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daeghaij, haet neix mwngz dingq denhgi yibau la?",
        "zh": "阿海，今天早上你听天气预报了吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dingq lo. Gou ngoenzngoenz cungj dingq.",
        "zh": "听了。我天天都收听。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngoenzneix yienh raeuz denhgibaenzlawzyiengh?",
        "zh": "今天我们县天气怎么样？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yienh raeuz ngoenzneix fwj lai, ceiq sang vwnhdu sam cib roek doh, ceiq daemq vwnhdu sam cib ngeih doh.",
        "zh": "我们县今天多云，最高温度36°C,最低温度32°C。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yo! Baenzneix hwngq ha! Gvaiq ndaej gou hanh lae mbouj dingz.",
        "zh": "哟！这么热啊？怪不得我汗流个不停。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dwg ha! Denhgi yibau naeuz, ngoenzcog lij hwngq gvaq ngoenzneix ne!",
        "zh": "是啊！天气预报说，明天比今天还要热呢！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laujveiz, mwngz raen Namzningz denhgi baenz lawzyiengh?",
        "zh": "老韦，你觉得南宁的天气怎么样？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Seizcin crnnx, seizhah ndat，seizcou sangj, seizdoeng raeuj.",
        "zh": "春天潮湿，夏天炎热，秋天凉爽，冬天温暖。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz gvenq cungj denhgi neix lwi?",
        "zh": "你习惯这种天气吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngamq daeuj geij bi haenx mbouj gvenq, seizneix gaenq gvenq lo.",
        "zh": "刚来那几年不习惯，现在习惯了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngoenzneix fwn doek mbouj guh hong, raeuz doengh geiz ndei mbouj ndei?",
        "zh": "今天下雨不干活，我们下棋好不好？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou dauq ndaej hoengq, hoeng gou mbwq mwngz baenzngoenz hoij geiz!",
        "zh": "我倒是有空，但我腻烦您成天悔棋！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeya! Doengh geiz gaijmbwq, mwngz nyiengh bouxgeq di youh baenzlawz?",
        "zh": "哎呀！下棋解闷，你让老人一些又如何？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Hwnj ciengq mbouj faen bohlwg. Mwngz laih gwn laeuj ha!",
        "zh": "上阵不分父子。您以为是喝酒呀！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "C, aengz baij geiz mwngz couh laih mwngz hingz ha!",
        "zh": "尚未摆棋你就以为你嬴呀！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj fug couh nda buenz geiz daeuj!.",
        "zh": "不服气就摆棋盘来！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Hai! Bouxlawz lau bouxlawz!",
        "zh": "嗨！谁怕谁！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij yinx duh mwngz dwg gijmaz?",
        "zh": "你的爱好是什么？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou yinx ep bya.",
        "zh": "我喜欢钓鱼。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ep bya daemz roxnaeuz ep bya dah?",
        "zh": "钓塘鱼还是钓河鱼？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dangyienz dwg ep bya dah lo, ep bya daemz miz maz eiqsei?",
        "zh": "当然是钓河鱼了，钓塘鱼有什么意思？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz ep ndaej ceiq lai dwg bya maz?",
        "zh": "你钓得最多的是什么鱼？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ceiq lai dwg byahaux, byaleix、byagaq hix ep ndaej gvaq.",
        "zh": "最多是鮎鱼，鲤鱼、獗鱼也钓到过。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou mbouj yinx ep bya, bae seizgan lai, gou mbouj miz naihsim. Gou yinx yawj densi.",
        "zh": "我不喜欢钓鱼，太费时间了，我没有耐心。我喜欢看电视。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yawj densi mwngz yinx yawj gijmaz cezmuz?",
        "zh": "看电视你喜欢看什么节目？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Sinhvwnz、lenzsuzgi、giuzsai cungj yinx.",
        "zh": "新闻、连续剧、球赛都喜欢。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou hix yinx yawj densi, mboujgvaq gou ceiq yinx dwg cezmuz《Seiqgyaiq Doenghduz》.",
        "zh": "我也喜欢看电视，不过我最喜欢的节目是《动物世界》。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laujlij, mwngz yinx dwk bej lwi?",
        "zh": "老李，你喜欢打扑克吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Lij yungh gangj! Mbouj rox suijbingz mwngz baenz lawzyiengh?",
        "zh": "还用说！不知道你的水平怎么样？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj dwg gou gangjboq, danhvei dou dwk bej lij caengz miz bouxlawz dwk ndaej hingz gou gvaq!",
        "zh": "不是我吹牛，我们单位打扑克还没人嬴过我！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou mbouj saenq! Haemhneix raeuz couh ra geij boux daeuj dwk haemh ndeu.“Dohlahgih\" baenzlawzyiengh?",
        "zh": "我不信！今天晚上咱们就找几个人打个通宵。＂拖拉机“怎么样？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj miz vwndiz. Raeuz gangj dingh lo!",
        "zh": "没有问题。咱们说定了！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laujveiz, mwngz dwg Bouxcuengh, mwngz daeuj gaisau gaisau fungsug sibgvenq Bouxcuengh hawj dou dingqdingq.",
        "zh": "老韦，您是壮族，您来介绍介绍壮族的风俗习惯给我们听听。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Fungsug sibgvenq Bouxcuengh lai lo. Gou daeuj gaisau gij laex daih hek Bouxcuengh ba!",
        "zh": "壮族的风俗习惯多了。我来介绍壮族的待客礼节吧。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndei ha. Danghnaeuz gou dwg bouxhek, daeuj daengz mbanj Cuengh, sou baenzlawzguh ne?",
        "zh": "好啊。假如我是客人，到了壮族村寨，你们会怎么做呢？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mboujlwnh bouxhek dwg bouxsai mehmbwk bouxgeq bouxcoz, raen le couh dongx, yiedcingz cingj bouxhek haeuj ranz.",
        "zh": "不论男女老少，见面就打招呼，热情地请客人进屋。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Haeuj ranz gvaq laeng ne?",
        "zh": "进屋以后呢？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bouxhek haeuj ranz gvaq laeng, cawjranz sikhaek ra daengq ra eij hawj bouxhek naengh. Danghnaeuz dwg bouxcoz daih hek, mbouj ndaej caeuq bouxhek caez naengh, yaek ndwn youq henz caeuq bouxhek gangj vah",
        "zh": "客人进屋以后，主人马上找凳子、椅子给客人坐。如果是青少年接待客人，不能与客人同坐，要站在一旁与客人谈话。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yienzhaeuh ne?",
        "zh": "然后呢？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bouxhek naengh roengzdaeuj le, couh ndingq caz hawj bouxhek. Caz aeu yungh song fwngz yienh hawj bouxhek, mbouj ndaej yungh fwngz ndeu yienh, mboujmiz couh dwg saetlaex.",
        "zh": "客人坐下来后，就给客人倒茶。要用双手递茶给客人，不能用一只手递，否则就是失礼。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yienzhaeuh ne?",
        "zh": "然后呢？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndingq caz hawj bouxhek le, bouxcawj caeuq bouxhek gangjgoj yaep he, couh bae cawj haeux loengh byaek daih hek. Haeux byaek cawj ndei le, cingj bouxhek haeuj daiz. Haeuj daiz miz gveigawj bw, hek bouxsai caeuq cawjranz bouxsai caemh daiz, hek mehmbwk caeuq cawjranz mehmbwk caemh daiz. Bouxhek gwn haeux seiz, bouxcoz ranzcawj fucwz ndingq laeuj. Bouxcawj mbouj ndaej dingz gwn laeuj gonq, yaek caemh bouxhek gwn gaeuq laeuj, lij aeu nip noh ndei byaek ndei hawj bouxhek gwn.",
        "zh": "给客人倒茶后，主人跟客人聊一会儿天，就去煮饭炒菜招待客人。饭菜煮好后，请客人入席。入席有规矩的啊，男客跟男主人同桌，女客跟女主人同桌。客人吃饭时，主家年轻人负责倒酒。主人不能先停饮，要陪客人喝足，还要夹好菜给客人吃。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gwn haeux liux ne?",
        "zh": "吃完饭呢？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gwn haeux sat le, bouxhek yaek baema, bouxcawj aeu louz hek",
        "zh": "吃完饭后，客人要回去，主人要挽留客人。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Baenzlawz louz hek ne?",
        "zh": "怎么留客呢？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cawz yungh vah daeuj louz, lij beng fwngz bouxhek beng dauq ndaw ranz, roxnaeuz daiq gij doxgaiq bouxhek daiq daeuj haenx bae yo hwnjdaeuj, hawj bouxhek mbouj miz banhfap ok dou. Danghnaeuz bouxhek itdingh yaek bae, bouxcawj hix mbouj nyengh louz bouxhek. Bouxhek ok dou seiz, ranzcawj daengx ranz vunz cungj daengz bakdou soengq.",
        "zh": "除用语言来留客外，还拉住客人的手往家里拉，或是把客人带来的物件拿走藏起来，让客人没有办法出门。如果客人执意要走，主人也不强留。客人出门时，主家全家人要到门口送行。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bouxcuengh caen dwg gyaez hek ha!",
        "zh": "壮族真是好客啊！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Baez neix daeuj Guengjsae, mwngz youz le gij dieg lawz la?",
        "zh": "这次到广西，您都游览了哪些地方？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Youz le Dahlizgyangh caeuq Bya'ndaengciengh Gveilinz、Yinzdanh Bwzhaij, lij miz Byaraiz Ningzmingz.",
        "zh": "游了桂林漓江和象鼻山、北海银滩，还有宁明花山。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj noix ma! Guengjsae miz haujlai dieg ndei youz, ndawde Gveilinz ceiq gyaeundei. Miz coenz vah gangj: \"Gveilinz bya dah gyaeu gvaq biengz. \" Bouxlawz daeuj daengz Guengjsae, danghnaeuz mbouj bae youz Gveilinz, couh beg daeuj lo.",
        "zh": "不少积广西有许多值得一游的地方，其中桂林最美。有句话说：“桂林山水甲天下。”谁来到广西，不去游桂林，就白来了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yinzdanh Bwzhaij hix gig ndeiyawj. Sci hau, raemxhaij saw.",
        "zh": "北海银滩也不错。沙白，海水清。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz roengz raemx bae youzraemx la?",
        "zh": "您下水游泳了？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Youz lo.",
        "zh": "游了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz nyinhnaeuz Byaraiz Ningzmingz baenz lawzyiengh?",
        "zh": "您觉得宁明花山怎么样？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gig saenzgeiz. Bangx bya miz baenzlai dozveh, mbouj rox dwg baenzlawz veh hwnjbae?",
        "zh": "太神奇了。崖壁上画了那么多图画，不知道是怎么画上去的？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou hix mbouj rox dwg baenzlawz veh hwnjbae.",
        "zh": "我也不知道是怎么画上去的。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij dozveh haenx dwg bouxlawz veh, ndaw veh dwg veh gijmaz?",
        "zh": "那些画是什么人画的？画里画的是什么？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gaengawq conhgyah yenzgiu, gij veh neix gaenq veh ndaej song cien lai bi lo, dwg cojsien Bouxcuengh Bouxlozyez veh. Gij veh neix mbangj veh gyoengqvunz bae dwknyaen, mbangj dwg gak cungj doenghduz, lumjbaenz duzgoep.",
        "zh": "根据专家的研究，这些画是两千多年前画上去的，是壮族的祖先骆越人画的。这些画有的画人们狩猎的场面，有的是各种各样的动物，例如青蛙。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daujyouz, ngoenzcog raeuz yaek bae gizlawz youz ne?",
        "zh": "导游，明天我们要到哪里游览？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngoenzcog raeuz yaek bae youz nazmbaeklae Lungzciz.",
        "zh": "明天我们要去游览龙脊梯田。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dingqnaeuz nazmbaeklae Lungzciz youq Lungzswng, liz Gveilinz gyae lwi?",
        "zh": "听说龙脊梯田在龙胜，离桂林远吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj gyae, liz ndawhaw Gveilinz miz gouj cib goengleix.",
        "zh": "不远，离桂林市区90公里。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raeuz youq gizhaenx youq lwi?",
        "zh": "咱们在那里住吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Youq haemh ndeu.",
        "zh": "住一个晚上。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Youzlanjceh seizlawz hai?",
        "zh": "旅游车什么时候出发？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Haetcog ci raeuz caet diemj buenq youq naj fanden hai, daihgya geiqndaej cinjseiz hwnj ci bw!",
        "zh": "明天早上咱们的车七点半在饭店前面出发，大家记得准时上车啊！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daj Namzningz bae Bwzswz baenzlawz bae?",
        "zh": "从南宁到百色怎么走？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Naengh giceh bae hix ndaej, naengh hojceh bae hix ndaej.",
        "zh": "坐汽车去也行，坐火车去也行。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Naengh ruz bae ndaej lwi?",
        "zh": "坐船去可以吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ruz menh yaekdai bae, seizneix bouxlawz lij naengh ruz bae dem!",
        "zh": "船慢得要命，现在谁还坐船去呢！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laujnungz, ranz sou ndaem baenzlai gomak, gag dawz mak bae gai baenzlawz gai ndaej liux?",
        "zh": "老侬，你们家种这么多果树，自己拿水果去卖怎么卖得完？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gag dawz bae gai dang'yienz gai mbouj liux lo. Seizneix dajndaem conhyezhu、dajciengx conhyezhu bouxlawz lij gag dawz bae gai?",
        "zh": "自己拿去卖当然卖不完。现在种植专业户、养殖专业户谁还自己拿去卖？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yienghneix sou baenzlawz guh ne?",
        "zh": "那你们怎么做呢？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "lliu caeuq gyoengqlauxbanjdiegrog dingh habdoengz, daengz seiz sou mak gyoengqde couh hai ci daeuj henz suenmak sou, suenq cienz couh ndaej lo.",
        "zh": "我们跟外地老板订合同，到收果的时候他们就开车到果园边来收购，结账就行了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "O, yienghneix couh ndei lai lo. Gai ndaej ngaenz le dajsuenq yungh guh gijmaz?",
        "zh": "哦，这样就太好了。卖果得到的钱打算拿来做什么？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dajsuenq hwng ranzmoq caeuq cawx doxgaiq ngoenzyungh.",
        "zh": "打算建新房和买日用品。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Lauxbanj, mwngz gizneix miz ien gai lwi?",
        "zh": "老板，你这里有香烟卖吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Miz ha. Mwngz aeu gijmaz baiz?",
        "zh": "有啊。你要什么牌子的？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "\"Hungzdazsanh\" baiz. Bau geijlai ngaenz?",
        "zh": "“红塔山”牌。多少钱一包？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cib ngeih maenz. Mwngz aeu geij bau?",
        "zh": "12元。你要儿包？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Danghnaeuz gou baenz diuz c.awx, noix di ndaej lwi?",
        "zh": "如果我整条买，可以少一点吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndaej, baenz diuz gai hawj mwngz diuz bak maenz.",
        "zh": "可以，整条卖给你100元一条。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Danghnaeuz gou lwnh sieng cawx, lij noix di ndaej lwi?",
        "zh": "如果我整箱买，还可以少一点吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Baenz sieng cawx gou hawj mwngz baefat gyaq, sieng gouj bak haj cib maenz.",
        "zh": "整箱买我给你批发价，950元一箱。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yienghneix gou cawx sieng ndeu.",
        "zh": "那我买一箱。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz baez ndeu cawx baenzlai ien guh gijmaz?",
        "zh": "你一次买这么多烟干什么？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gvaq song ngoenz ranz dou cingj laeuj yungh.",
        "zh": "过两天我们家办喜酒用。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Goeng'heij mwngz lo.",
        "zh": "恭喜你了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Docih mwngz.",
        "zh": "谢谢你。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laujcinz, mwngz bae gvaq Baekging lwi?",
        "zh": "老覃，你去过北京吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bae gvaq song baez lo.",
        "zh": "去过两次了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Naengh hojceh bae roxnaeuz naengh feihgih bae?",
        "zh": "坐火车去还是坐飞机去？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Baez daih'it bae, dwg ngeih cib bi gaxgonq, naengh hojceh bae; baez daihngeih bae, dwg bi'gvaq, naengh feihgih bae.",
        "zh": "第一次去，是20年前，坐火车；第二次去，是去年，坐飞机去。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Naengh hojceh dwg cawx biuqyingco roxnaeuz biuqngobuh?",
        "zh": "坐火车是坐硬座还是卧铺？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Seizhaenx gizlawz miz cienz cawx biuqngobuh lo.",
        "zh": "那时哪里有钱买卧铺票啊。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Naengh hojceh daj Namzningz bae daengz Baekging aeu geijlai nanz?",
        "zh": "坐火车从南宁去到北京要多长时间？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Seizhaenx yaek aeu seiq cib aen cungdaeuz, dingqnaeuz seiz neix vaiq lai lo, sam cib aen cungdaeuz hwnjroengz couh daengz lo.",
        "zh": "那时得要40个小时，听说现在快多了，30个小时左右就到了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Naengh feihgih bae ne?",
        "zh": "坐飞机去呢？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Sam aen cungdaeuz hwnjroengz couh daengz lo.",
        "zh": "3个小时左右就到了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Sam aen cungdaeuz! Caen vaiq ha!",
        "zh": "3个小时！真快啊！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cingj mwngz naengh aen eij neix. Mwngz siengj raed cungj fazhingz lawz?",
        "zh": "请坐这张椅子。你想剪什么发型？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou raen seizneix cungj fazhingz neix ceiq seizhwng, mwngz bang gou guh cungj fazhingz neix ba.",
        "zh": "我觉得现在这种发型最流行，你给我剪这种发型吧。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gak vunz gak gyaeuj. Gyaeuj mwngz guh",
        "zh": "各人的头形不一样你的头剪这种发型不怎么好看。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yienghneix couh youz mwngz dingh ba. Mboujgvaq gaej louz raez lai.",
        "zh": "那就由你定吧。不过不要留得太长。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": ", mwngz siengj yungh geuz raed roxnaeuz yungh fagfei fei?",
        "zh": "你想用剪刀剪还是用理发推子理？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yungh geuz raed ba.",
        "zh": "用剪刀剪吧。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raed ndei lo, mwngz yawj lij yungh gaij gizlawz dem?",
        "zh": "剪好了，你看还用改什么地方吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj yungh lo. Mwngz raed ndaej gig ndei.",
        "zh": "不用了。你剪得很好。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz yaek ingjsiengq ha?",
        "zh": "你要照相吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dwg vei. Ngoenzneix ingj, seizlawz ndaej lingx siengq?",
        "zh": "是的。今天照，什么时候可以领相片？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz ingj siengqbujdungh roxnaeuz siengqgyavaiq?",
        "zh": "你照普通照还是快照？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Siengqgyavaiq.",
        "zh": "快照。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Siengqgyavaiq lai bengz di bw!",
        "zh": "快照要贵一点哟！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj youqgaenj law.",
        "zh": "不要紧。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gizneix miz gyauhgenj gai lwi?",
        "zh": "这儿有胶卷卖吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Miz, miz Fusw gyauhgenj caeuq Gohdaz gyauhgenj.",
        "zh": "有，有富士的和柯达的。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gienj geijlai cienz?",
        "zh": "多少钱一卷？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Fusw gienj cib bet maenz, Gohdaz gienj cib haj maenz.",
        "zh": "富士18元一卷，柯达15元一卷。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou aeu sam gienj Fusw.",
        "zh": "要3卷富士。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gungh haj cib seiq maenz ngaenz.",
        "zh": "一共54元。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Neix dwg haj cib seiq maenz, mwngz geqgeq.",
        "zh": "这是54元，你数数。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gaeuq lo, docih mwngz. Ndei byaij!",
        "zh": "够了，谢谢你。走好！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Caiq raen!",
        "zh": "再见！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dahyinz, mwngz miz sienggih lwi?",
        "zh": "阿云，你有相机吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Miz vei.",
        "zh": "有啊。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngoenzcog ban dou bae youz Byacwx, mwngz ciq sienggih mwngz hawj gou yungh ngoenz ndeu ndaej lwi?",
        "zh": "明天我们班要去游大明山，你能借你的相机给我用一夭吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndaej ha, haemmheix mwngz daeuj ranz gou aeu ba.",
        "zh": "行啊，今天晚上你到我家来拿吧。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndei, gou swnhbienh bae bouqingjsiengq cawx song gienj gyauhgenj.",
        "zh": "好，我顺便去照相馆买两卷胶卷。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj yungh cawx gyauhgenj. Sienggih gou dwg sumaj sienggih.",
        "zh": "不用买胶卷。我的相机是数码相机。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz yaek youq lijgvanj ha?",
        "zh": "您要住旅馆吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "W. Gou siengj aeu aen fuengzvunzdog. Ndaw fuengz miz maz sezbi?",
        "zh": "嗯。我想要个单人房。房间里有什么设备？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndaw fuengz miz densigih、gunghdiuz caeuq denva.",
        "zh": "房间里有电视机、空调和电话。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Miz veiswnghgenh caeuq raemxndat lwi?",
        "zh": "有卫生间和热水吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dang'yienz miz la. Raemxndat ngeih cib seiq aen cungdaeuz cungj miz.",
        "zh": "当然有了。热水24小时都有。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndei, gou youq song haemh.",
        "zh": "好，我住两个晚上。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cingj mwngz dienz mbaw biuj neix gonq.",
        "zh": "请您先填这张表。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou dienz ndei lo.",
        "zh": "我填好了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz miz maz doxgaiq dijbauj, cmgj youq fuzvudaiz baujgvanj.",
        "zh": "您有什么贵重的东西，请在服务台保管。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cienzat dwg geijlai?",
        "zh": "押金是多少？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz gyau bak maenz ndaej lo. Aen fuengz mwngz youq 302 hauh, neix dwg yaekseiz.",
        "zh": "您交100元就行了。您的房间在302号，这是钥匙。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Docih mwngz lo.",
        "zh": "谢谢您了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz miz maz saeh couh daj denva daeuj fuzvudaiz.",
        "zh": "您有什么事就打电话到服务台。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Fuzvuyenz, gou yaek doiq fuengz, cingj gietsoq.",
        "zh": "服务员，我要退房，请结账。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cingj caj yaep he. Hawj laeuzcaengz fuzvuyenz bae genjcaz aen fuengz mwngz gonq.",
        "zh": "请等一下。先让楼层服务员去检查一下您的房间。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndaej lo. Mwngz gungh youq sam haemh, mwngz gyau sam bak maenz ba.",
        "zh": "可以了。您一共住3天，您交300元吧。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Neix dwg sam bak maenz.",
        "zh": "这是300元。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Neix dwg fazbyau caeuq cienzat. Vanhyingz mwngz baezlaeng caiq daeuj. Mwngz ndei byaij!",
        "zh": "这是发票和押金。欢迎您下次再来。您走好！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Docih mwngz lo!",
        "zh": "谢谢您了！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daengz seizgan gwnringz lo, raeuz caez bae gwn ba",
        "zh": "到吃午饭的时间了，咱们一起去吃吧。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndei ha. Bae gizlawz gwn?",
        "zh": "好啊。去哪里吃？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou rox Cunghvaz Lu baihde miz aen Swconh fan'gvanj ndeu, feihdauh mbouj loek.",
        "zh": "我知道中华路那边有一家四川饭馆，味道不错。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Byaek Swconh manh lai, gou mbouj gyaez gwn geijlai.",
        "zh": "川菜太辣了，我不怎么喜欢吃。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou gyaez gwn byaek Guengjdoeng.",
        "zh": "我喜欢吃粤莱。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yienghneix raeuz bae gwn byaek Guengjdoeng ba.",
        "zh": "那咱们就去吃粤莱吧。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Sou ndei! Sou geij boux ne?",
        "zh": "你们好！请问几位呢？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Haj boux. Miz bauhsiengh lwi?",
        "zh": "5位。有包厢吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Miz. Cingj haeujdaeuj.",
        "zh": "有。请进。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Neix dwg danbyaek.",
        "zh": "这是菜单。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raeuz ngoenzneix gak boux gag diemj, bouxlawz gyaez gwn gijmaz couh diemj gijmaz, gou ok ngaenz.",
        "zh": "咱们今天各人自己点，谁喜欢什么就点什么，我请客。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou aeu faenh byaleix bauq ndeu.",
        "zh": "我要一份炸鲤鱼。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou aeu faenh byalwg cauj duhhenj ndeu.",
        "zh": "我要一份小鱼炒黄豆。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou aeu faenh hing'oiq cauj nohyiengz ndeu.",
        "zh": "我要一份嫩姜炒羊肉。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou aeu faenh nohgaeq cauj raetmoegngaex ndeu.",
        "zh": "我要一份鸡肉炒木耳。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ca mbouj lai lo, gou couh diemj faenh dang gyaeujbya rangzsoemj ndeu, caiq gya faenh byaekaengjgwxbohliz cauj ndeu.",
        "zh": "差不多了，我就点一份酸笋鱼头汤，再加一份炒玻璃生菜。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeu laeuj lwi?",
        "zh": "要酒吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeu vei! Aeu song bingz laeuj Gveilinz Sanhvah.",
        "zh": "要啊！要两瓶桂林三花。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndei. Sou gwn cenj caz caj yaep he.",
        "zh": "好。你们喝杯茶等一会儿。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz ndei!",
        "zh": "您好！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz ndei! Mwngz yaek cunz cienz roxnaeuz lingx cienz?",
        "zh": "您好！您要存钱还是取钱？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou siengj cunz cienz.",
        "zh": "我想存钱。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz cunz dinggiz roxnaeuz hozgiz?",
        "zh": "您存定期还是活期？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou cunz dinggiz, cunz sam fanh maenz.",
        "zh": "我存定期，存3万元。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cunz geij bi?",
        "zh": "存几年？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cunz bi ndeu.",
        "zh": "存一年。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cingj mwngz dienz mbaw cunzgvanjdanh neix gong.",
        "zh": "请您先填写这张存款单。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou dienz ndei lo.",
        "zh": "我填好了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Banh ndei lo. Neix dwg cunzcez mwngz, cingj dawz ndei.",
        "zh": "办好了。这是您的存折，请拿好。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Danghnaeuz cunzcez gou doek bae, gou wngdang baenzlawz guh ne?",
        "zh": "如果我的存折丢失，我该怎么办？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz daeuj ngaenzhangz dou bauqsaet couh ndaej lo.",
        "zh": "您到我们银行挂失就行了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Docih mwngz. Caiq raen!",
        "zh": "谢谢您。再见！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Caiq raen!",
        "zh": "再见！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz ndei! Gou siengj vuenh cienz.",
        "zh": "您好！我想换钱。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Vuenh gijmaz cienz?",
        "zh": "换什么钱？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou siengj aeu cienz meijyenz vuenh baenz yinzminzbi.",
        "zh": "我想把美元换成人民币。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz vuenh geijlai?",
        "zh": "您换多少？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Haj bak meijyenz.",
        "zh": "500美元。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cingj mwngz dienz mbaw biuj neix.",
        "zh": "请您填这张表。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngoenzneix meijyenz doiq yinzminzbi, bijgya dwg geijlai?",
        "zh": "今天美元对人民币，比价是多少？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "It meijyenz vuenh roek diemj caet maenz inzrninzbi. Gizneix dwg cienz mwngz. Gungh sam cien sam bak haj cib manz, mwngz geq yawj.",
        "zh": "1美元换6.   7元人民币。这是您的钱，一共3350元，您数数看。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doiq lo. Gou siengj dawz song mbaw bak maenz vuenh aeu mbaw cib maenz ndaej lwi?",
        "zh": "对了。我想把这两张100元换成10元一张可以吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndaej ha.",
        "zh": "可以啊。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Docih mwngz lo.",
        "zh": "谢谢您了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj yungh. Caiq raen!",
        "zh": "不用。再见！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou siengj geiq fung saenq bae Baekging.",
        "zh": "我想寄封信去北京。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Geiq bingzsaenq roxnaeuz gvaqhauhsaenq?",
        "zh": "寄平信还是挂号信？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gvaqhauhsaenq fung geijlai cienz?",
        "zh": "挂号信多少钱一封？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeu yawj fungsaenq mwngz miz geijlai naek.",
        "zh": "要看您的信有多重。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz ndei!",
        "zh": "您好！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz ndei! Mwngz yaek geiq gijmaz?",
        "zh": "你好！你要寄什么？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou moouj geiq gijmaz. Gou siengjcawx byuksaenq caeuq youzbiuq.",
        "zh": "我不寄什么。我想买信封和邮票。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeu geijlai aen byuksaenq? Geijlai cienz youzbiuq?",
        "zh": "要多少个信封？多少钱的邮票？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeu cib aen byuksaenq caeuq ngeih cib maenz youzbiuq.",
        "zh": "要10个信封和20元的邮票。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Neix dwg cib aen byuksaeq caeuq ngeih cib maenz youzbiuq. Mwngz lij aeu gijrnaz?",
        "zh": "这是10个信封和20元的邮票。您还要什么吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yo! Dauq mingzsinben neix gig gyaeundei, dauq geijlai cienz?",
        "zh": "哟！这套明信片很好看，多少钱一套？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dauq cib ngeih maenz.",
        "zh": "12元一套。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou cawx dauq ndeu.",
        "zh": "我买一套。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz gizlawz mbouj cwxcaih?",
        "zh": "你哪里不舒服？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou gyaeujdot、ae.",
        "zh": "我头痛、咳嗽。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ae geij ngoenz la?",
        "zh": "咳嗽几天了？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Song ngoenz lo.",
        "zh": "两天了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Fatndat lwi?",
        "zh": "发烧吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Miz di.",
        "zh": "有点儿。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Rau dijvwnh caeuq hezyaz baez he.",
        "zh": "量一下体温和血压。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Canghyw, gou baenz gijmaz bingh la?",
        "zh": "我得了什么病？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj youqgaenj, mwngz dwgliengz lo. Gwn di yw, lai gwn raemxgoenj, yietnaiq song sam ngoenz couh ndei lo.",
        "zh": "不要紧，你感冒了。吃点药，多喝开水，休息两三天就好了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yungh dajcim lwi?",
        "zh": "用打针吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj yungh dajcim. Mwngz dawz mbaw clan neix bae laj laeuz gyau cienz, yienzhaeuh bae fuengzyw aeu yw.",
        "zh": "不用打针。你拿这张单子到楼下交费，然后到药房取药。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Docih mwngz lo.",
        "zh": "谢谢你了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Neix dwg gij yw mwngz.",
        "zh": "这是你的药。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Baenzlawz gwn ne?",
        "zh": "怎么吃呢？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngoenz sam baez, baez gwn song naed.",
        "zh": "一天3次，每次吃两粒。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Docih mwngz lo.",
        "zh": "谢谢你了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz ngoenzneix bae haw lwi?",
        "zh": "你今天去赶集吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bae vei! Miz maz saeh lwi?",
        "zh": "去啊！有什么事吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bang gou cawx di doxgaiq, ndaej lwi?",
        "zh": "请帮我买点东西，可以吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cawx gijmaz?",
        "zh": "买什么东西呢？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cawx diuz ien hungzmeiz ndeu.",
        "zh": "买一条红梅香烟。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndaej ha.",
        "zh": "行啊。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Docih mwngz lo. Neix dwg cienz.",
        "zh": "谢谢你了。这是钱。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Guh gijmaz hong?",
        "zh": "做什么活？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Sou haeux. Mwngz daeuj bang gou, gou ngoenzlaeng bae bang mwngz.",
        "zh": "收稻子。你来帮我，过后我去帮你。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Couh yienghneix dingh lo.",
        "zh": "就这么定了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndei! Naek lai lo, cingj dawz gij saw ndaw doengjgvih okdaeuj gong.",
        "zh": "好的！太重了，请先把抽屉里的书本拿出来。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Veq di, mienx deng bungq sieng.",
        "zh": "请让开，免得碰伤。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj youqgaenj.",
        "zh": "不要紧。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doiq mbouj gvaq, gou daeuj laeng lo.",
        "zh": "对不起，我来晚了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz guhmaz baezbaez doxiek cungj daeuj nguh a? Mwngz yawjyawj biuj, gaenq geij diemj lo?",
        "zh": "你怎么约会老迟到啊？你看看表，都几点了？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Saedcaih doiq mbouj gvaq! Yaek roengzban seiz, lauxbanj sawqmwh heuh gou fuzyin geij faenh caizliu. Gou fuzyin liux le, okdaeuj youh raen aen danci mbouj miz heiq lo, cijndaej daj dih daeuj, mboujngeix youh deng saek ci. Mwngz naeuz boihseiz mbouj boihseiz?",
        "zh": "实在对不起！快要下班的时候，老板忽然要我复印几份材料。我复印完了，出来又发现自行车没气了，只能坐出租车来，不巧又碰上堵车。你说倒霉不倒霉？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz cungj dwg miz leix.",
        "zh": "你总是有理。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndaej lo, gaej fatheiq lo, baenzlaeng gou itdingh...",
        "zh": "好了，别生气了，下回我一定......",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Baezbaez cungj \"baezlaeng baezlaeng\", baezlaeng bouxlawz lij saenq mwngz. Mwngz laihnaeuz gou miz baenzlai seizgan caj mwngz ha!",
        "zh": "每次都”下回下回”的，下回谁还相信你呀。你以为我有那么多时间等你呀！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yo, mwngz caij din gou lo.",
        "zh": "哟，你踩我的脚了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Caen doiq mbouj gvaq, gou mbouj dwg daegdingq yienghneix guh. Youqgaenj lwi?",
        "zh": "真对不起，我不是故意的。要紧吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj youqgaenj law.",
        "zh": "不要紧的。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou ra Veiz Haij sienseng.",
        "zh": "我找韦海先生。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gizneix mbouj miz Veiz Haij sienseng.",
        "zh": "这里没有韦海先生。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aen denva neix haumaj mbouj dwg 3262198 ha?",
        "zh": "这部电话号码不是3262198吗？",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj dwg, dwg 3261298.",
        "zh": "不是，是3261298。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Doig mbouj gvaq, gou daj loeng denva lo.",
        "zh": "对不起，我打错电话了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Lauxsae, ngoenzcog dou couh yaek okbae gungh coz lo, haemhneix dou daeuj caeuq mwngz doxbiek",
        "zh": "老师，明天我们就要出去工作了，今天晚上来跟您告别。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Seizgan gvaq ndaej caen vaiq ha! Baez yaep da seiq bi couh gvaqbae lo.",
        "zh": "时间过得真快啊！一眨眼4年就过去了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dwg vei, lauxsae, geij bi neix mwngz vih gyoengq dou dwgrengz lo.",
        "zh": "是啊，老师，这几年您为了我们辛苦了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Lauxsae, geij bi neix mwngz son hawj dou cihsiz, lij son dou guh vunz, dou ciuhvunz cungj mbouj lumz.",
        "zh": "老师，这几年您教给我们知识，还教我们做人，我们一辈子都忘不了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Lauxsae couh lumj bohmeh dou nei.",
        "zh": "老师就像我们的父母一样。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raen sou maj hung baenz caiz, gou hix sim'angq ha!",
        "zh": "看见你们成长成材，我也高兴啊！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj caeux lo, dou baema lo.",
        "zh": "不早了，我们回去了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou bae soengqsoengq sou.",
        "zh": "我去送送你们。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Lauxsae, mbouj yungh soengq lo, mwngz baema ba!",
        "zh": "老师，不用送了，您回去吧。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cuk sou swnh raemx swnh rurnz!",
        "zh": "祝你们一路顺风！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Docih lauxsae!",
        "zh": "谢谢老师！",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Lauxlungz, baez neix gou roengz mbanj, gwn youq cungj youq ranz sou, caujfanz sou lo.",
        "zh": "老伯，这次我下乡，吃住都在你们家，麻烦你们了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gangj gijmaz caujfanz! Gou caeuq mwngz gangjgoj hix rox ndaej haujlai cwngcwz moq.",
        "zh": "说什么麻烦！我跟你聊天也知道了很多新的政策。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngoenzlaeng mwngz miz maz saeh, couh bae yangh cwngfuj ra gou.",
        "zh": "以后有什么事，到乡政府找我。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndei. Ngoenzcog mwngz couh yaek baema lo, haemhneix gou heuh yah gou loengh geij yiengh byaek, raeuz ndoet song cenj.",
        "zh": "好。明天你就要回去了，今天晚上我让我妻子弄几个菜，咱们喝两杯。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Docih mwngz, mbouj yungh bofei lo.",
        "zh": "谢谢您，不用破费了。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bofei gijmaz! Bit gaeq byaekheu cungj dwg gag ciengx gag ndaem.",
        "zh": "破费什么！鸡鸭青菜都是自养自种。",
        "source": "zhuangyu900ju-dialogue"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Miz sam ae.",
        "zh": "有三个男人",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dah neix aeng lai.",
        "zh": "这女孩作风轻佻。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeyo! In raixcaix.",
        "zh": "哎哟！痛得很。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De ngoenzneix aiq mbouj daeuj lo.",
        "zh": "他今天也许不来了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj raek liengj bae, ajlah fwn doek yaek baenzlawz guh?",
        "zh": "不带伞去，万一下雨怎么办？",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dawz aen gihgi neix an ndei dwk.",
        "zh": "把这台机器安装好。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Angj buh moq hawj vunz yawj.",
        "zh": "炫耀新衣服给人家看。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou annaeuz de bae hagdangz lo.",
        "zh": "我以为他上学校去了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gienh saeh neix gou auq yawj guh ndaej baenz lwi.",
        "zh": "这件事我试试看做得不做得。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Hanh biu lo.",
        "zh": "冒汗了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngoenzlwenz gangj ndei lo, ngoenzneix caiq boekbyonj.",
        "zh": "昨天已经讲好了，今天又反悔。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Boemz vaih bae aen bingz ndeu.",
        "zh": "摔破了一个瓶子。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Boemz youq gwnz daiz.",
        "zh": "伏在桌子上。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Boengh maknganx neix miz haj gaen naek.",
        "zh": "这束龙眼果有五斤重。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Lwgnyez boenz namh.",
        "zh": "小孩玩弄泥巴。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gaej youq boihlaeng gangj vunz.",
        "zh": "别在背后议论人家。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aen mauh deng rumz bongj bae lo.",
        "zh": "帽子被风刮走了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bonjdaeng dwg de bae, hoeng de mbouj bae.",
        "zh": "本来应该是他去，但是他不去。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ndaek vunz neix bou lai.",
        "zh": "这个人太无能了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aen lauxbaeg neix bou lo.",
        "zh": "这个萝卜空心了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Sam bouq loh.",
        "zh": "三十里路。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daj gizneix buq gvaqbae.",
        "zh": "从这里取捷径走过去。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gvaq youz mboujcaengz hawq, gaej bungq deng bw!",
        "zh": "油漆未干，别碰着啵！",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbwn ndat lai, byaengq buh bae.",
        "zh": "天气太热了，解开衣服扣子。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De byaeu lo.",
        "zh": "他完蛋了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laeuj byaq.",
        "zh": "酒走气",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gaeqlwg byoeng okdaeuj lu.",
        "zh": "鸡仔脱壳而出了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbatneix byoeng lo.",
        "zh": "这次完蛋了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ciengz byoengq lo.",
        "zh": "墙穿窟窿了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Diuz buh mwngz daenj byonj lo.",
        "zh": "你穿反了衣服。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aen ndoengj bywnz liux lo.",
        "zh": "簸箕的边沿破了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cih saw neix sij ndaej mbouj hab, ca bae.",
        "zh": "这个字写得不对，删掉。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou caeuq mwngz beij, ca ndaej gyae lo.",
        "zh": "我和你比，差得远了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cauj lwgmanh cad yaek dai.",
        "zh": "炒辣椒呛得很难受。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laeq lwgnyez meix doek roengz dah bae, caeklaiq miz vunz gouq. mbouj ne, dai lo.",
        "zh": "这孩子掉下河去，幸亏有人救，否则就死了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aen ruz caem roengz haij bae lo.",
        "zh": "船沉下海底去了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aen daeng neix youz yaek liux lo. caem di youz roengz bae.",
        "zh": "这盏灯油快完了，加点油下去。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bingh de caem lo.",
        "zh": "他病危了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Diuz rap neix caem lai.",
        "zh": "这担子很重。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz caeuq de caemh bi.",
        "zh": "你和他同年。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gou caemh bae.",
        "zh": "我也去。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Haxbaenh cauzhuhu, lauxsae baez daeuj couh caemrwd.",
        "zh": "刚才嘈哄哄，老师一来，就安静下来了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Sou guh hong caen roengzrengz.",
        "zh": "你们做工真起劲。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeu aen caen bae coux laeuj.",
        "zh": "要樽去盛酒。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Saej mou saedcaih raeuz, rox cawj caengh baenz gwn.",
        "zh": "猪肠实在滑，会煮才好吃。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yungh mbouj caenh.",
        "zh": "用不尽。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Caenh rengz guh hong.",
        "zh": "尽力工作。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz gaej caenhrox couh de.",
        "zh": "你别一味迁就他。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Caenx haeujbae yawj.",
        "zh": "挤进去看。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aen ranz neix vunz youq caenx lai.",
        "zh": "这房子人住得太挤了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij byaek neix caepcatcat mbouj ndei gwn.",
        "zh": "这些菜冷冷的，不好吃。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Laeq lwgnyez neix caen mbouj rox caepndat.",
        "zh": "这孩子真不知好歹。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeu caet daeuj caet daiz.",
        "zh": "拿漆来漆桌子。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De caetneix mbouj youq ranz.",
        "zh": "他现在不在家。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Vunz daeuj caez lo.",
        "zh": "人来齐了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Caih de baenzlawz gangj, raeuz gaej leix de.",
        "zh": "随便他怎样讲，我们别理他。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngoenzneix ra mbouj raen, ngoenzcog caiq daeuj ra.",
        "zh": "今天找不见，明天再来找。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Camhcej gaejbah bae.",
        "zh": "暂且别忙去。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeu camj daeuj camj gaeq.",
        "zh": "拿鸡罩来罩鸡。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Caizcawj gwn canz cij hawj bouxhoiq gwn.",
        "zh": "财主吃剩的残余才给奴仆吃。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De gwn mwngz catsaij lo.",
        "zh": "他吃你的空子了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz gaej cau gou.",
        "zh": "你别打扰我。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Caujfanz mwngz lo.",
        "zh": "打扰你了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yinzminz danggya guh cawj.",
        "zh": "人民当家做主。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daej song cawx vanj.",
        "zh": "今天我上街买了二十个碗。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "It bi miz seiq cawz.",
        "zh": "一年有四季。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij haeux neix ndaem daiq cax lai.",
        "zh": "这秧插得太稀了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Meh vaiz neix roengz lwg cax lai.",
        "zh": "这头母牛生仔次数间隔时间太长。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aen ndoeng neix faex caxcadcad.",
        "zh": "这片山林树木稀稀疏疏的。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ce!Gaej doeng loengh sae loengh.",
        "zh": "啐！别东搞西搞。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ce aen mak hawj daegnuengx gwn.",
        "zh": "留一个果子给弟弟吃。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Faq ciengz neix ceg lo.",
        "zh": "这堵墙裂开了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aen ranz neix ceiq ndei.",
        "zh": "这间房子最好。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aen fuengz neix cek iai.",
        "zh": "这间房子很窄",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cengq fan naeng vaiz neix bae dak.",
        "zh": "撑开这张牛皮拿去晒。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gwn daiq lai, cengq dwk dungx yaek dek.",
        "zh": "吃得太多，撑得肚子快要裂开了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Rap ndaej geij lai suenq geij lai, gaej cengqgengz.",
        "zh": "挑得多少算多少，不要勉强支撑。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raemx cenj lai.",
        "zh": "水很浅。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngoenz gwn hong mbouj guh, cet gwnz cet laj.",
        "zh": "每天吃饭不做工，东游西荡。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Rumz baek ci oo.",
        "zh": "北风呼呼地吹。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz guh ndaej daiq cied lo.",
        "zh": "你做得太绝了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gienh saeh neix de guh ndaej daiq ciedcingz lo.",
        "zh": "这件事他做得太绝情了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Lau dwk dungx cieg bae.",
        "zh": "害怕得肝胆破裂。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cieng daengz lo.",
        "zh": "春节到了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cingj mwngz cienq gvaq baih neix daeuj.",
        "zh": "请你转过这边来。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij neix dwg cienzrom.",
        "zh": "这是攒下来的钱。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De gig gaenx, ciep ndaej boh de.",
        "zh": "他很勤，很象他爸爸。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Guh daengz ngoenzneix cij, ngoenzcog mbouj guh lo.",
        "zh": "做到今天为止，明天不做了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Yienghneix guh cij ndaej.",
        "zh": "这样做才行。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raeuz cijaeu roengzrengz guh hong, bineix itdingh demsou.",
        "zh": "只要我们努力生产，今年一定能增产。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Cijnaeuz heuh mwngz bae haihoih? Mwngz vih maz lij youq gizneix?",
        "zh": "不是说叫你去开会吗？",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbwn yaek laep lo, Liuz Vaz cijndei umj yiengzlwg baema ranz.",
        "zh": "天将黑了，刘华只好抱着小羊儿回家。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeu cik daeuj rau baengz.",
        "zh": "要尺子来量布。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gangj vah mbouj miz cikconq.",
        "zh": "讲话没有分寸。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz cimz yawj, gij byaek neix ndei gwn lwi?",
        "zh": "你尝看，这菜好吃吗？",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De seizneix cingq doeg saw.",
        "zh": "他现在正读书。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Boux vunz neix cingqging.",
        "zh": "这个人端庄正派。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Haemhneix ronghndwen cingxdikdik.",
        "zh": "今夜月光皎洁。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bineix haeux beij bi'gvaq demsou song cingz.",
        "zh": "今年粮食比去年增收两成。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gimq cit feiz coemh ndoeng.",
        "zh": "禁止放火烧山林。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Vanj byaek neix citcangcang.",
        "zh": "这碗菜淡淡的。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz miz maz citgeiz!",
        "zh": "你有什么了不起！",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij doxgaiq neix miz gijmaz citgeiz?",
        "zh": "这些东西有什么希罕？",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aen rek neix fong cib ciuq.",
        "zh": "这个锅补了十个补疤。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gijvax neix roh song ciuq.",
        "zh": "这瓦漏了两个洞。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dah neix cix lai.",
        "zh": "这女孩很轻佻。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz gaej cix lai.",
        "zh": "你不要逞能。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Vunz cungj bae youz liux lo, de cix youq ranz yawj saw.",
        "zh": "别人都去玩了，他却在家看书。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Danghnaeuz mwngz bae, gou cix mbouj bae lo.",
        "zh": "假若你去，我就不去了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De hoj cixbah, vanzlij deng feiz remj ranz dem.",
        "zh": "他穷还不算，而且被火烧房子。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De mbouj daeuj cixliux.",
        "zh": "他不来就算了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Veh diuz sienqneix ciz lo.",
        "zh": "这条线划斜了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dawz di haeux neix coeg hau bae.",
        "zh": "把这点米舂白",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mbouj ndaej coeg gyaeuj lwgayez.",
        "zh": "不能敲小孩的头。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dizyinz daengz Yenzanh seiz, ra mbouj raen saek boux vunz, gyoengqde coemjhoengq lo!",
        "zh": "敌人到延安时，找不到任何一个人，他们扑空了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gij coh mwngz heuh maz?",
        "zh": "你的名字叫什么？",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Buh lig lo, noh conh ok daeuj lo.",
        "zh": "衣服破了，肌肉露出来了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raeuz conj bae hai hoih.",
        "zh": "我们全体去开会。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Haemhneix gou bae coq raemx naz.",
        "zh": "今晚我去灌田水。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Seizneix gou couh bae.",
        "zh": "现在我就去。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz gaej couh de.",
        "zh": "你不要迁就他。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De couhdwg baengz youx gou.",
        "zh": "他就是我的朋友。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De lij coz.",
        "zh": "他还年轻。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aeu ceij daeuj cumh dangz.",
        "zh": "用纸来包糖。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Raemx ndat lai, cung di raemx caep roengzbae.",
        "zh": "水太热了，冲点冷水下去。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gangj vah unqswnh di, gaej cungcangh vunz.",
        "zh": "讲话要和霭些，不要得罪人。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Iz cungj.",
