        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ra mbouj raen daeuzloh.",
        "zh": "找不到门路。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz bae yiengq de daeuzsae.",
        "zh": "你去向他请教。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gaeg－ [honghlaj] ) dahoengz vunz.",
        "zh": "你不要妒忌别人。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngoenzcog gou bae dahraix.",
        "zh": "明天我真的去。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De gig daihliengh.",
        "zh": "他很慷慨。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ciengz denyingj neix daiq ndei yawj lo.",
        "zh": "这场电影太好看了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De miz daixbaj saw.",
        "zh": "他有很多书。",
