    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De youq giz haenx dajdek.",
        "zh": "他在那里神气十足地坐着。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ngoenzneix mwngz dajsuenq guh gijmaz?",
        "zh": "今天你打算做什么？",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Lauxsae gangj, de dingq mbouj rox, dalaep yaek dai.",
        "zh": "老师讲，他听不懂，不感兴趣。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Diuz dah neix song henz dan gig gvangq.",
        "zh": "这条河两岸沙滩宽广。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Dan di hawj de.",
        "zh": "摊一点给他。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De dan miz geu buh ndeu.",
        "zh": "他只有一件衣服。",
