        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De angq danz gimz.",
        "zh": "他爱弹琴。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Lauxsae gauj suyoz, de cungj dap deng lo.",
        "zh": "老师考数学，他都答对了。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Bat raemx neix gaej raix liux bae, dauh di youq ndaw de.",
        "zh": "这盆水不要倒光，留一点在里面。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "De youq gizhaenx doeg saw, mwngz gaej bae dauj de.",
