        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Haemhneix gou bae demq nyaenmak.",
        "zh": "今晚我去伺捕果子狸。",
        "source": "zhuang_dictionary"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Mwngz gangj deng lo.",
