        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Aexyax, gou lumz fagseiz youq ndaw ranz lo.",
        "zh": "哎呀，我把钥匙忘在家里了。",
        "source": "textbook"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Ha, mwngz caemh saenq gij vah de!",
